  'yield_target_quintal_per_acre exceeds the ceiling computed for this variety, layout and plot',
  'उत्पादन लक्ष्य या जात, लागवड पद्धत व शेतासाठी काढलेल्या कमाल मर्यादेपेक्षा जास्त आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Warn rather than reject. Compute the ceiling from the variety rating, the planting layout and the plot record instead of applying one fixed number. Where the target exceeds it, show the computed ceiling and ask what supports the higher figure. Do NOT scale fertiliser or water doses to a target the ceiling does not support.',
  'थेट नाकारण्याऐवजी इशारा द्या. एकच ठराविक आकडा न लावता जात, लागवड पद्धत आणि शेताच्या नोंदींवरून कमाल मर्यादा काढा. लक्ष्य त्याहून जास्त असल्यास काढलेली मर्यादा दाखवा आणि जास्त आकड्याला आधार काय आहे ते विचारा. मर्यादेला आधार नसलेल्या लक्ष्यावर खत किंवा पाण्याच्या मात्रा काढू नका.',
  'Best recorded variety capacity is 94 q/acre. Even with the full broad-ridge multiplier and optimal drip the theoretical maximum is about 130. EXPERT AMENDMENT: 130 quintal per acre is not a hard limit. The ceiling varies with variety, management and region, so the rule warns and shows its working rather than rejecting outright.',
  'Prevents systematic dose error across every input domain. Fertiliser and irrigation are computed in proportion to expected yield, so an inflated target corrupts all of them simultaneously.',
  0.8, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The original plot target of 350 quintal per acre came from an earlier advisory and is 6.6 times the state average. This rule exists because that number nearly entered the rule base and would have mis-dosed every farmer on the platform.');

