  'Escalate mulch and irrigation-timing advisory. Confirm stage 1 mulch is in place. Split drip into morning and evening runs. Do not irrigate at midday.',
  'आच्छादन घातले आहे का ते तपासा. ठिबक सकाळ-संध्याकाळ दोन पाळ्यांत चालवा, दुपारी नको. उघड्या काळ्या जमिनीचे तापमान हवेपेक्षा बरेच जास्त असते आणि बेणे भाजू शकते.',
  'Optimal soil temperature for sprouting is 25-26 C. Recorded maxima in this district reach 45.9 C, and bare black soil surface runs hotter than air. Leaves scorch above 35 C. EXPERT AMENDMENT: threshold lowered from 38 C to 35 C. The expert judged the earlier figure unsafe — protection should begin at the point where scorching is documented to start, not above it.',
