ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

  'percolation_time_hours is high for the soil texture class AND drainage is poor',
  'जमिनीच्या प्रकाराच्या तुलनेत निचऱ्याचा वेळ जास्त आहे आणि जलनिचरा खराब आहे',
  '(soil_texture_class == ''heavy'' AND percolation_time_hours > 12) OR (soil_texture_class == ''medium'' AND percolation_time_hours > 8) OR (soil_texture_class == ''light'' AND percolation_time_hours > 6)', 'dsl-1.0', 'ONCE_UNTIL_RESOLVED', FALSE, NULL,
  'Assess drainage suitability against the soil texture class rather than a single fixed hour count. Judge on three things together: soil texture (heavy, medium or light), how long water actually stands after rain, and whether an outlet exists. Advise against ginger only where all three point the same way. Provisional guidance by texture: heavy soil above about 12 hours, medium above about 8, light above about 6 — to be replaced by measured values.',
  'एकाच ठराविक तासांच्या आकड्यावर नव्हे, जमिनीच्या प्रकारानुसार निचऱ्याची योग्यता ठरवा. तीन गोष्टी एकत्र पहा — मातीचा प्रकार (भारी, मध्यम, हलकी), पावसानंतर पाणी प्रत्यक्षात किती वेळ साचून राहते, आणि शेताबाहेर निचरा होण्याची सोय आहे का. तिन्ही एकाच दिशेने असतील तरच अद्रक टाळण्याचा सल्ला द्या. तात्पुरते मार्गदर्शन — भारी जमिनीत सुमारे १२ तासांहून जास्त, मध्यम जमिनीत सुमारे ८, हलक्या जमिनीत सुमारे ६. हे आकडे प्रत्यक्ष मोजमापाने बदलावेत.',
  'Soft rot requires inoculum, a host and free water. Inoculum persists and the host is fixed by the planting decision, so free water is the only controllable term. If it cannot be controlled, the disease cannot be managed. EXPERT AMENDMENT: a single fixed hour count is not appropriate. Percolation must be judged against soil texture class, observed standing-water duration and outlet availability together.',
  'Prevents exposure to u = 0.50 to 0.90.',
  0.8, 'A', 'DERIVED', 0.7, 'none',
  'This is a one-day, zero-cost test that can prevent a Rs 1.45 lakh loss. It is more decisive for ginger than any laboratory chemical parameter, because the governing risk in this crop is physical rather than chemical.');

