  'drainage_levels_present less than 3 OR main_drain_connected is false, before planting',
  'निचऱ्याच्या तिन्ही पातळ्या पूर्ण नाहीत किंवा मुख्य चर शेताबाहेर जोडलेला नाही',
  '(drainage_levels_present < 3 OR main_drain_connected IS FALSE) AND dap IS NULL', 'dsl-1.0', 'ONCE_UNTIL_RESOLVED', FALSE, NULL,
  'Require all three drainage levels before planting: (1) bed height 25-30 cm, (2) 60 cm furrows between beds, (3) a main channel at the lowest point of the field, connected to an outlet outside the field.',
  'लागवडीपूर्वी निचऱ्याच्या तिन्ही पातळ्या पूर्ण असाव्यात — वरंब्याची उंची २५-३० सेंमी, दोन वरंब्यांतील ६० सेंमी पाट, आणि शेताच्या सर्वात खालच्या टोकाला मुख्य चर जो शेताबाहेर मोकळा होतो.',
  'The third level is the one most often omitted. Raised beds and furrows only move water within the field; without an outlet the water circulates and the beds stand in it.',
  'u = 0.15 to 0.30 for inadequate drainage, rising toward 0.70 if it triggers a full soft rot outbreak.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-D', 0.22, 'partial',
  'July here delivers about 195 mm, the wettest month, and the crop is then at end of G2 or start of G3 — the most sensitive point. Drainage channels are not a monsoon task; they must exist before planting.');

