  'Forecast exceeds 50 mm rain in 48 hours AND stage is G2 or G3',
  'पुढील ४८ तासांत ५० मिमीहून जास्त पावसाचा अंदाज आणि पीक G2 किंवा G3 अवस्थेत',
  'forecast_rain_48h_mm > 50 AND STAGE IN [G2, G3]', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Pre-warn: check that all three drainage levels are clear of silt, and stop drip. After the rain, check for saturation within 12 hours.',
  'निचरा चर मोकळे आहेत का तपासा, ठिबक बंद करा. पाऊस थांबल्यावर १२ तासांत पाणी साचले आहे का पहा.',
  'Channels silt up during the season and are usually only noticed when they fail. A forecast-triggered check converts a reactive failure into a scheduled inspection.',
  'Reduces the probability of the saturation event that drives soft rot.',
  0.8, 'A', 'SRC-D', NULL, 'partial',
  'This rule must also fire in October and November, not only during the monsoon. Cyclonic rainfall reaches this district in those months, and by then the channels have been neglected for weeks while the rhizome is fully formed.');

