  'Pre-season planning AND percolation_time_hours is unknown',
  'हंगामापूर्व नियोजन, निचरा चाचणी झालेली नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Request the field percolation pit test. 30 cm deep and wide, fill and drain fully, refill and time the second drain. Record percolation_class.',
  '३० सेंमी खोल व रुंद खड्डा खणा, पाण्याने भरून पूर्ण मुरू द्या, पुन्हा भरा आणि वेळ मोजा. दोन तासांत मुरले तर उत्तम; बारा तासांहून जास्त लागल्यास या शेतात अद्रक टाळावे.',
  'For ginger the governing soil risk is physical drainage, not chemical fertility. No laboratory report measures infiltration rate on the actual plot.',
  'Determines bed height and channel design, and in the worst case the go or no-go decision.',
  0.8, 'B', 'EST', NULL, 'full',
  'Zero cost, one day, no laboratory. For this crop in this soil it is arguably more decisive than the chemical panel.');

