  'Land preparation phase, deep_ploughing_done is false',
  'पूर्वमशागत सुरू, खोल नांगरट झालेली नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Require deep ploughing to about one foot, both lengthwise and crosswise, followed by kulav passes until the tilth is friable and clod-free.',
  'एक फुटापर्यंत उभी व आडवी खोल नांगरट करा, नंतर कुळवाच्या पाळ्या देऊन जमीन भुसभुशीत करा. काळ्या जमिनीत ढेकळे मोठी होतात, त्यामुळे तीन ते चार पाळ्या लागू शकतात.',
  'The crop stays in the soil for eight months and the rhizome expands horizontally. It needs a loose lateral working layer; compacted soil produces small and misshapen rhizomes.',
  'Not separately quantified. Acts through rhizome size rather than plant count.',
  0.88, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'Official guidance says one to two kulav passes. Black soil forms larger clods, so three to four is more realistic here, and a rotavator is often needed to finish.');

