  'Month is March AND deep_ploughing_done is false',
  'मार्च महिना, खोल नांगरट बाकी',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Start deep ploughing now. In black soil the workable window is narrow and closes once the pre-monsoon showers begin. Starting in May is already too late.',
  'खोल नांगरट आत्ता सुरू करा. काळी जमीन मार्चमध्ये कोरडी व कडक असते — तीच नांगरटीची योग्य वेळ. मे मध्ये सुरू केल्यास उशीर होतो आणि पाऊस सुरू झाल्यावर मशागत अशक्य होते.',
  'Vertisol is unworkable when wet (clods and structural damage) and resists implements when bone dry. The usable window is short and falls in March for this belt.',
  'Missing the window compresses all subsequent operations and risks planting after the 7 June deadline.',
  0.8, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'partial',
  'The chain is tight: March ploughing, April solarization, May bed forming and drip, planting by 7 June. Losing March compresses everything downstream.');

