  'Soil moisture enters the workable band after rain AND land preparation is incomplete',
  'पावसानंतर वाफसा आला आणि मशागत अपूर्ण आहे',
  'vafsa_state == ''workable'' AND deep_ploughing_done IS FALSE', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Notify that the field is workable for approximately the next three to four days.',
  'पुढील तीन-चार दिवस मशागतीस योग्य आहेत. वाफसा गेल्यावर काळ्या जमिनीत काम करता येणार नाही.',
  'Vafsa is the intermediate moisture state between sticky and hard. In black soil it lasts only a few days and judging it by eye is unreliable.',
  'Indirect. Protects soil structure and prevents lost operating days.',
  0.7, 'B', 'EST', NULL, 'full',
  'This is a genuinely sensor-enabled advisory with no manual equivalent. The farmer currently judges vafsa by squeezing a handful of soil, which is a coarse test on a narrow window.');

