  'FYM application scheduled AND fym_fully_decomposed is false or unknown',
  'शेणखत टाकायचे आहे पण ते पूर्ण कुजलेले आहे का हे माहीत नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Verify decomposition before applying. Criteria: dark brown to black, no smell, original material no longer recognisable. If half-decomposed, either let it decompose further or mix Metarhizium with it.',
  'शेणखत पूर्ण कुजले आहे का तपासा — गडद तपकिरी किंवा काळे, वास नाही, मूळ पदार्थ ओळखू येत नाही. अर्धवट कुजलेले असल्यास आणखी कुजू द्या, किंवा मेटॅरायझियम मिसळा.',
  'White grub larvae feed first on organic matter in half-decomposed FYM and then move to roots. Decomposition heat also kills weed seed. So one condition addresses a pest problem and a weed problem simultaneously.',
  'u = 0.10 estimated for white grub damage traceable to undecomposed FYM.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-D', 0.1, 'none',
  'Because the FYM rate here is high at 14 to 16 tonnes per acre, the white grub exposure from undecomposed material is proportionally larger than in belts using half that quantity.');

