  'FYM application scheduled',
  'शेणखत टाकण्याची वेळ',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Mix Trichoderma at 2 kg per acre into the FYM at the time of application. Do not broadcast it separately onto bare soil.',
  'शेणखतात ट्रायकोडर्मा २ किलो प्रति एकर मिसळून द्या. नुसते जमिनीवर टाकू नये.',
  'Trichoderma is a living organism and needs an organic substrate to colonise. Applied to bare soil it does not establish; applied through FYM it survives and works through the season.',
  'u = 0.08 estimated for omitting it, acting through soft rot and nematode suppression.',
  0.8, 'A', 'SRC-Q', 0.08, 'partial',
  'Cheapest and safest soft rot measure available, with no CIB&RC restriction and no pre-harvest interval. It must be applied at land preparation, so a missed window cannot be recovered later in the season.');

