  'Month is April or early May AND field is empty AND solarization_done is false',
  'एप्रिल किंवा मे ची सुरुवात, शेत रिकामे, सौरीकरण झालेले नाही',
  'MONTH IN [APR, MAY] AND days_to_planting > 30 AND solarization_done IS FALSE', 'dsl-1.0', 'WINDOW', FALSE, NULL,
  'Recommend soil solarization for four to six weeks. Moisten the soil, lay TRANSPARENT (not black) polythene, seal the edges with soil, and remove before planting.',
  'जमीन ओलसर करून पारदर्शक प्लास्टिक अंथरा, कडा मातीने बंद करा, चार ते सहा आठवडे ठेवा आणि लागवडीपूर्वी काढा. काळे नव्हे — पारदर्शक प्लास्टिक वापरावे, कारण काळे स्वतः तापते पण उष्णता जमिनीत जाऊ देत नाही.',
  'Solarization raises topsoil temperature enough to kill soil-borne pathogens, nematodes and weed seed. It is a recognised cultural measure in soft rot management.',
  'u = 0.05 estimated for omitting it.',
  0.75, 'A', 'SRC-D', 0.05, 'none',
  'April and May maxima here reach 40 to 45 C, among the most favourable conditions in the country for solarization. The same heat that threatens the crop after planting is an asset before it. Since soft rot is the dominant risk in this belt, this is a genuine local advantage and should be trialled in a strip against an untreated strip in season one.');

