  'soil_type is vertisol AND has_drip is true AND planting_layout is not broad_ridge',
  'काळी जमीन, ठिबक आहे, पण रुंद वरंबा पद्धत निवडलेली नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Require broad ridge layout. The official recommendation names this method specifically for black soils and for fields using drip or sprinkler, and records 15 to 20 percent higher yield than the alternatives.',
  'रुंद वरंबा किंवा गादी वाफा पद्धत वापरा. काळ्या जमिनी आणि ठिबक-तुषार वापरल्या जाणाऱ्या ठिकाणी हीच पद्धत शिफारसीत आहे, आणि इतर पद्धतींपेक्षा १५ ते २०% जास्त उत्पादन मिळते.',
  'Both qualifying conditions are met at Kannad — the soil is black and drip is a precondition for the crop here. The method raises the root zone above standing water and suits single-line drip.',
  'u = 0.167 for not using it, derived from the recorded 20 percent gain.',
  0.9, 'A', 'SRC-Q', 0.167, 'none',
  'This is the highest-return structural decision in the knowledge base and its marginal cost is close to zero, because a bed former takes the same time either way. It also reduces plant population by roughly 44 percent against flat beds, which cuts the largest cost line while raising yield.');

