  'Bed forming scheduled AND area_acre greater than 1',
  'वाफे बांधायचे आहेत आणि क्षेत्र एक एकरहून जास्त',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Arrange a tractor-drawn bed former before land preparation reaches the bed stage. Hand-forming beds is not practical beyond a small area and the machine setting for 60/60 geometry must be arranged with the operator in advance.',
  'मोठ्या क्षेत्रावर हाताने वाफे बांधणे व्यवहार्य नाही. ट्रॅक्टरचे सरी यंत्र आधीच ठरवा, आणि ६०/६० रचनेसाठी यंत्राची मांडणी चालकाशी बोलून निश्चित करा.',
  'Bed geometry determines drainage, plant population and drip layout. If the machine cannot be set correctly the whole layout decision fails at execution.',
  'Indirect. Protects the 0.167 u-value from being lost at implementation.',
  0.7, 'A', 'EST', NULL, 'partial',
  'Documented machine settings exist for 120 cm wide beds in onion. The 60 cm ridge with 60 cm furrow arrangement for ginger will need confirmation with a local operator before the season.');

