  'Land preparation reaching final stage',
  'जमीन तयार करण्याचा शेवटचा टप्पा',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Apply the full phosphorus and basal potassium dose now — 30 kg P and 30 kg K per acre. Nitrogen is NOT basal.',
  'स्फुरद व पायाभूत पालाश यांची संपूर्ण मात्रा आत्ताच द्या — एकरी ३० किलो स्फुरद आणि ३० किलो पालाश. नत्र पायाभूत देऊ नये.',
  'Phosphorus is immobile and must be placed in the root zone before planting. All state recommendations agree on full basal P. Basal potassium is the first of three potassium applications; the remaining two follow in Domain 4.',
  'Part of the overall nutrition schedule; not separately quantified here.',
  0.9, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'Original figures are 75:75 kg per hectare, converted to 30:30 per acre. Adjust against the soil test where available.');

