  'Basal phosphorus scheduled AND soil_free_lime_pct is elevated',
  'पायाभूत स्फुरद द्यायचा आहे आणि मातीत चुनखडी आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Band the phosphorus rather than broadcasting it, and place it with organic matter. Do NOT increase the dose to compensate for fixation — the extra also gets fixed.',
  'स्फुरद पसरून न देता पट्ट्यात द्या, आणि सेंद्रिय पदार्थासोबत द्या. चुनखडीमुळे स्फुरद स्थिर होतो म्हणून मात्रा वाढवू नये — वाढवलेलाही तेवढ्याच प्रमाणात स्थिर होतो. उत्तर मात्रा नाही, पद्धत आहे.',
  'In calcareous soil applied phosphorus binds with calcium into unavailable calcium phosphate. Banding reduces soil contact and therefore fixation; organic acids from decomposing matter keep more of it available; phosphate-solubilising bacteria release some of the fixed pool.',
  'Prevents wasted input rather than adding yield. Also explains why the Mahima-specific trial recommends lower phosphorus and higher potassium than the general schedule.',
  0.8, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'none',
  'The instinctive response to poor phosphorus availability is to apply more. In calcareous soil that is the wrong answer and it is expensive.');

