  'Planting is imminent AND has_drip is false',
  'लागवड जवळ आली आणि ठिबक बसवलेले नाही',
  'has_drip IS FALSE AND WITHIN(planting_date, 30 DAYS)', 'dsl-1.0', 'ONCE_UNTIL_RESOLVED', FALSE, NULL,
  'Block planting readiness. Drip must be laid, tested and operational BEFORE planting, because monsoon onset here is unreliable and germination water may have to come from the system.',
  'ठिबक लागवडीपूर्वी अंथरून, चाचणी करून, कार्यरत असले पाहिजे. इथे मान्सून अनिश्चित आहे — लागवड करून पाऊस लांबल्यास उगवणीचे पाणी ठिबकातूनच द्यावे लागेल.',
  'Kannad receives about 734 mm against a crop requirement of 1320 to 1520 mm, and 55 percent of years fall below the long-term average. Rainfed establishment is not a reliable fallback.',
  'Failure at G1 is irrecoverable because establishment count caps the season.',
  0.88, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'none',
  'Pre-monsoon rainfall in Marathwada has declined by about 31 percent, so the traditional practice of planting with pre-monsoon showers is now less reliable than when that recommendation was written.');

