  'previous_crops_3yr contains ginger, turmeric, potato, tomato, brinjal or chilli',
  'मागील तीन वर्षांत आले, हळद, बटाटा, टोमॅटो, वांगी किंवा मिरची घेतलेली आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Warn that rotation requirement is not met. Ginger and turmeric share soil-borne pathogens; the solanaceous crops are hosts for bacterial wilt. Recommend a different plot if one is available.',
  'फेरपालट पाळलेली नाही. हळद व आले एकाच कुळातील असल्याने त्यांचे soil-borne रोग सामाईक आहेत; बटाटा, टोमॅटो, वांगी, मिरची हे मर रोगाचे यजमान आहेत. शक्य असल्यास दुसरा प्लॉट निवडा.',
  'Continuous cropping raises infection risk from both Pythium and Ralstonia. Minimum recommended gap is three years, and the wilt bacterium can persist longer than that.',
  'u = 0.15 estimated for rotation failure alone; substantially higher if a wilt outbreak follows.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-D', 0.15, 'none',
  'Three years is the stated minimum, but bacterial wilt is documented as persisting in soil for many years. Where wilt has actually been recorded on the plot, three years should be treated as insufficient.');

