  'soil_oc_pct less than 0.75',
  'सेंद्रिय कर्ब ०.७५ टक्क्यांपेक्षा कमी',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Inform that organic carbon is below target and that raising it is a three to four season programme, not a single-season fix. FYM, neem cake and mulch all contribute.',
  'सेंद्रिय कर्ब लक्ष्यापेक्षा कमी आहे. तो एका हंगामात वाढत नाही — शेणखत, निंबोळी पेंड आणि आच्छादन यांतून तीन-चार हंगामांत वाढतो. ही तूट भरून काढणे हे दीर्घकालीन काम आहे.',
  'Target is above 1 percent; Marathwada black soil typically runs 0.3 to 0.5 percent. Organic carbon governs water holding, microbial activity and micronutrient availability, all of which matter more in calcareous heavy soil.',
  'Not directly quantified. Acts through drainage, nutrient availability and disease suppression.',
  0.75, 'B', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'partial',
  'Setting the expectation honestly matters here. A farmer told to reach 1 percent organic carbon this season will conclude the advice failed. Told it is a four-season programme, the same inputs are seen as working.');

