  'Water supply assessed as marginal',
  'पाण्याची उपलब्धता जेमतेम आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Recommend a lined farm pond to capture monsoon runoff for the October to February period. This stores the water that the drainage channels are already carrying away.',
  'शेततळे विचारात घ्या. मान्सूनमध्ये जे पाणी निचरा चरातून वाहून जाते तेच साठवून ऑक्टोबरनंतर वापरता येईल — म्हणजे एकाच रचनेतून दोन्ही समस्या सुटतात.',
  'Monsoon water must be removed from the root zone to prevent soft rot, and the same water is short four months later. Storage converts a disposal problem into a supply solution.',
  'Reduces exposure to both the waterlogging pathway and the late-season exhaustion pathway.',
  0.75, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Plastic lining carries 50 percent subsidy up to a ceiling under the state scheme. Sizing against the 27 lakh litre October to February shortfall has not yet been done and is an open item.');

