  'soil_texture_class is heavy AND drip design not set to the heavy-soil configuration',
  'जमीन भारी आहे पण ठिबकाची मांडणी भारी जमिनीसाठी नाही',
  'has_drip IS TRUE AND drip_lateral_spacing_ft IS NULL', 'dsl-1.0', 'ONCE_UNTIL_RESOLVED', FALSE, NULL,
  'Set inline drip to the heavy soil configuration: lateral spacing 4.5 to 5 feet, dripper spacing 40 cm, dripper flow 2 lph. Do NOT use close dripper spacing at high flow on clay.',
  'मध्यम ते भारी जमिनीसाठी — ठिबक नळीतील अंतर ४.५ ते ५ फूट, ड्रीपरमधील अंतर ४० सेंमी, ड्रीपरचा ताशी प्रवाह २ लिटर. काळ्या जमिनीत जवळचे ड्रीपर व जास्त प्रवाह वापरू नये.',
  'In heavy soil water spreads laterally, so wider dripper spacing still produces a continuous wetted strip. Close spacing at high flow exceeds the infiltration rate, water ponds on the surface and the system itself becomes a cause of soft rot.',
  'Not quantified directly. Prevents a self-inflicted route into the largest loss factor in the crop.',
  0.88, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'partial',
  'A wrongly specified drip set is a permanent cost that then causes disease every season. This is a one-time decision that a supplier quotation will not necessarily get right without being told the soil class.');

