  'Drip configuration set',
  'ठिबकाची मांडणी ठरली',
  'has_drip IS TRUE AND drip_system_flow_lph IS NULL', 'dsl-1.0', 'ONCE_UNTIL_RESOLVED', FALSE, NULL,
  'Compute and store system hydraulics: about 7,380 drippers per acre giving about 14,760 litres per hour. All runtime advisory derives from this figure.',
  'प्रति एकर सुमारे ७,३८० ड्रीपर, ताशी सुमारे १४,७६० लिटर. ठिबक किती वेळ चालवायचे हे सर्व गणित याच आकड्यावरून येते.',
  'Runtime cannot be advised without knowing system flow. Deriving it once at installation removes a recurring source of error.',
  'Indirect. Determines whether the intended volume actually reaches the crop.',
  0.85, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Actual dripper count should be verified on installation rather than assumed. A 10 percent error here shifts every runtime figure by 10 percent.');

