  'Planting date within 15 days AND drip not laid and tested',
  'लागवडीला १५ दिवस उरले आणि ठिबक अंथरून चाचणी झालेली नाही',
  'has_drip IS FALSE AND WITHIN(planting_date, 15 DAYS)', 'dsl-1.0', 'ONCE_UNTIL_RESOLVED', FALSE, NULL,
  'Block planting readiness. Drip must be operational before planting because monsoon onset is unreliable and germination water may have to come from the system.',
  'ठिबक लागवडीपूर्वी अंथरून, चाचणी करून, कार्यरत असले पाहिजे. लागवड करून पाऊस लांबल्यास उगवणीचे पाणी ठिबकातूनच द्यावे लागेल, आणि उगवण चुकली तर ती भरून निघत नाही.',
  'Establishment count is a hard ceiling for the season and cannot be recovered by gap filling. Pre-monsoon rainfall in this region has declined by about 31 percent, so the traditional practice of planting with pre-monsoon showers is less reliable than when the recommendation was written.',
  'Protects the establishment ceiling set at G1.',
  0.88, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'none',
  'Subsidy approval involves a lottery and takes months, so the drip decision belongs six or more months before planting, not fifteen days before.');

