  'Daily irrigation planning AND station evaporation data unavailable',
  'रोजचे सिंचन नियोजन, station चा बाष्पीभवन डेटा उपलब्ध नाही',
  'has_drip IS TRUE AND pan_evaporation_mm_day IS NULL AND dap BETWEEN 0 AND 225', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', FALSE, NULL,
  'Use the month-wise table as the base requirement. Range is 8,400 litres per acre per day in May to 22,000 in September and October. Flag confidence as medium and state that the figure is a regional average.',
  'महिनानिहाय तक्त्यानुसार पाणी द्या — मे मध्ये ८,४०० लिटर प्रति एकर प्रति दिवस, सप्टेंबर-ऑक्टोबरमध्ये शिखर २२,००० लिटर. हा विभागीय सरासरीचा आकडा आहे.',
  'The table is published for Maharashtra ginger under drip and internally consistent — litres equal mm times 4000 for every month.',
  'Provides a complete working irrigation schedule with no sensor dependency, so the system functions from day one.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'full',
  'This table alone can run the entire season''s irrigation. Sensors and the weather station improve on it; they do not replace it. That is what makes graceful degradation real rather than a slogan here.');

