  'Daily irrigation planning AND pan_evaporation_mm_day is available from the cluster station',
  'station कडून प्रत्यक्ष बाष्पीभवन उपलब्ध आहे',
  'pan_evaporation_mm_day IS NOT NULL AND dap BETWEEN 0 AND 225', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', FALSE, NULL,
  'Compute requirement as evaporation times crop coefficient times pan coefficient times 4000, and use it in preference to the table. Raise confidence to high.',
  'पाण्याची गरज = बाष्पीभवन × पीक गुणांक × बाष्प पात्र गुणांक × ४०००. तक्त्याऐवजी हा रोजचा आकडा वापरा.',
  'The only locally variable term in the equation is evaporation. Kannad is hotter and drier than the belt the table averages over, so the regional figure is systematically wrong here in one direction.',
  'Improves dosing accuracy across the whole season and eliminates both chronic over- and under-watering.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'full',
  'This is the single most defensible technical differentiator in the product. A competitor without hardware in the same village cannot produce this number, and the accumulated evaporation series becomes a FIELD-class asset that exists in no publication.');

