  'Stage changes',
  'अवस्था बदलली',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Adjust sampling frequency: hourly in G1, G3 and G4, four-hourly in G2 and G5, daily in G0, and hourly at all stages during a rain alert.',
  'अवस्थेनुसार sensor वाचनाची वारंवारता बदला — G1, G3, G4 मध्ये तासाला एकदा; G2 आणि G5 मध्ये चार तासांनी; पावसाच्या इशाऱ्यादरम्यान सर्व अवस्थांत तासाला.',
  'Sampling frequency should scale with stage criticality and with the rate at which the risk can develop. Saturation damage accrues over hours, so hourly sampling is needed when the crop is sensitive.',
  'Indirect. Affects how early a saturation event is detected.',
  0.75, 'B', 'EST', NULL, 'full',
  'Battery and LoRa airtime are finite on the sub-node, so frequency scaling is also a power management decision, not only an agronomic one.');

