  'Hardware upgrade under consideration',
  'hardware सुधारणेचा विचार',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Record the three-depth measurement requirement in the capability gap register: 10 cm for the rhizome zone, 20 cm for root base stress, 30 cm for drainage. One point at 10 cm is adequate for season one.',
  'तीन खोलींवर मोजमाप हवे — १० सेंमी गड्डा क्षेत्र, २० सेंमी मुळांचा तळ, ३० सेंमी निचरा. पहिल्या हंगामासाठी १० सेंमीचा एक बिंदू पुरेसा.',
  'A reading at 30 cm showing saturation while 10 cm does not indicates water rising from below, meaning drainage is blocked. That is detectable before anything is visible at the surface.',
  'Would improve early detection of the largest loss pathway.',
  0.7, 'B', 'EST', NULL, 'full',
  'Recorded rather than acted on. The single most valuable hardware addition remains a leaf wetness sensor for Domain 6, followed by this.');

