  'yield_target_quintal_per_acre exceeds 130 OR doses being scaled to an unsupported target',
  'उत्पादन लक्ष्य क्षमतेपेक्षा जास्त धरून मात्रा काढल्या जात आहेत',
  'yield_target_quintal_per_acre > ceiling_quintal_per_acre', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', FALSE, NULL,
  'Do NOT scale fertiliser doses to the inflated target. Recompute against the validated ceiling range of 90 to 110 quintal per acre.',
  'फुगवलेल्या उत्पादन लक्ष्यावर खत मात्रा काढू नका. मात्रा उत्पादनाच्या प्रमाणात मोजल्या जातात, म्हणून चुकीचे लक्ष्य म्हणजे सर्वच मात्रा चुकीच्या.',
  'Nutrient requirement is computed as removal per tonne times expected yield. If expected yield is wrong, every dose is wrong in the same proportion.',
  'Over-application wastes money and damages soil. Under-application from a wrong target limits yield. Both follow from the same error.',
  0.88, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'This is the practical consequence of the yield target correction in Domain 1. It is also why the published fertigation schedule cannot be used as printed — it targets a higher yield than is achievable here.');

