  'Earthing up scheduled at about 80 DAP',
  'सुमारे ८० दिवस, उटाळणीची वेळ',
  'dap BETWEEN 78 AND 88 AND n_split_2_date IS NULL', 'dsl-1.0', 'WINDOW', FALSE, NULL,
  'Apply the second and FINAL nitrogen split, about 24 kg N per acre, together with 600 to 800 kg per acre of neem or karanj cake. Bundle with earthing up and mulch stage two so all are done in one field visit.',
  'नत्राचा दुसरा आणि शेवटचा हप्ता द्या — एकरी सुमारे २४ किलो नत्र, सोबत करंज किंवा निंबोळी पेंड ६०० ते ८०० किलो. उटाळणी आणि आच्छादनाचा दुसरा टप्पा याच फेरीत करा.',
  'This is the last nitrogen of the season. Combining it with earthing up incorporates it into the soil at the same time as the operation that stimulates new root formation, and neem cake applied with urea produced the highest available nitrogen in a documented trial.',
  'Carries both the nitrogen split value and, through bundling, protects the 0.125 earthing up value.',
  0.88, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'This single field visit carries six actions from five domains and is the most important operational day of the season. Labour must be arranged from about 60 DAP because August is also when cotton and soybean intercultivation competes for the same workers.');

