  'Phosphorus application scheduled',
  'स्फुरद द्यायची वेळ',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Apply the full phosphorus dose as basal at land preparation. Phosphorus is immobile and is needed early for root development.',
  'स्फुरदाची संपूर्ण मात्रा जमीन तयार करतानाच द्या. स्फुरद जमिनीत हलत नाही आणि तो सुरुवातीच्या मूळ विकासासाठी लागतो.',
  'All state recommendations agree on full basal phosphorus. It does not move in soil, so top-dressing later does not reach the root zone.',
  'Part of the overall nutrition schedule; not separately quantified.',
  0.9, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'Basal placement is also covered in Domain 2 as part of land preparation. Repeated here because the dose belongs to the nutrition schedule.');

