  'soil_free_lime_pct elevated OR soil_ph greater than 7.5',
  'मातीत चुनखडी आहे किंवा सामू ७.५ पेक्षा जास्त',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Band the phosphorus with organic matter rather than broadcasting. Use PSB in the seed treatment. Do NOT increase the phosphorus dose to compensate for fixation.',
  'स्फुरद पसरून न देता पट्ट्यात, सेंद्रिय पदार्थासोबत द्या. बीजप्रक्रियेत PSB वापरा. चुनखडीमुळे स्फुरद स्थिर होतो म्हणून मात्रा वाढवू नये — वाढवलेलाही तेवढ्याच प्रमाणात स्थिर होतो. उत्तर मात्रा नाही, पद्धत आहे.',
  'In calcareous soil applied phosphorus binds with calcium into unavailable calcium phosphate. Banding reduces soil contact and so reduces fixation; organic acids from decomposing matter keep more of it available; phosphate solubilising bacteria release part of the fixed pool.',
  'Prevents wasted input rather than adding yield. Also explains why the Mahima-specific trial uses lower phosphorus than the general schedule.',
  0.8, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'none',
  'Phosphoric acid through drip has a second benefit here — it is acidic, so it lowers pH locally at the emitter and also keeps the lines clear of scale in hard alkaline water.');

