  'Consider sulphate of potash instead of muriate for the late splits. It is chloride free and supplies sulphur.',
  'उशिराचे पालाश हप्ते MOP ऐवजी SOP मधून देण्याचा विचार करा. SOP क्लोराईडमुक्त आहे आणि गंधकही देते.',
  'Drip concentrates salts at the wetting front and there is no leaching rain in this period, so chloride from MOP accumulates. SOP avoids that and supplies sulphur, which is commonly deficient in black soil. The published fertigation schedule itself switches to SOP for the earthing-up application, which suggests the distinction is deliberate.',
