  'Basal application being planned',
  'पायाभूत मात्रा ठरवली जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Include magnesium sulphate about 25 kg per acre at basal, and continue about 2.4 kg per acre weekly through fertigation where drip is used.',
  'पायाभूत मात्रेत मॅग्नेशिअम सल्फेट एकरी सुमारे २५ किलो द्या, आणि ठिबक असल्यास आठवड्याला सुमारे २.४ किलो चालू ठेवा.',
  'Calcium, magnesium and sulphur are all taken up in larger quantities than phosphorus, yet receive far less attention. SSP already supplies sulphur and calcium as a side benefit.',
  'Not separately quantified.',
  0.75, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'partial',
  'Sulphur deficiency is common in black soil. Choosing SSP over DAP for part of the phosphorus supplies about 11 percent sulphur and 20 percent calcium as a by-product, which is why the published basal schedule uses 300 kg SSP.');

