  'soil_free_lime_pct > 10 AND micronutrient_spray_1_done IS FALSE', 'dsl-1.0', 'ONCE_UNTIL_RESOLVED', FALSE, NULL,
  'Review whether weekly calcium nitrate is needed. Calcareous soil already supplies abundant calcium, and calcium nitrate also adds nitrogen, which is unwanted this late.',
  'चुनखडीयुक्त जमिनीत कॅल्शिअम आधीच भरपूर आहे. कॅल्शिअम नायट्रेटमधून नत्रही जाते, जे या टप्प्यावर नको. माती परीक्षणानुसार गरज तपासा.',
  'The published fertigation schedule adds calcium nitrate weekly from 130 DAP for skin hardening and storage quality. On calcareous soil the calcium is not limiting, and the nitrate fraction conflicts with the no-nitrogen-after-80-DAP rule.',
  'Avoids an unnecessary input and an unwanted late nitrogen source.',
  0.7, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'A clear example of why a published schedule cannot be applied unmodified. It was written for general soil; here one of its components is redundant and mildly counterproductive.');

