  'Basal application being planned',
  'पायाभूत मात्रा ठरवली जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Include neem cake 300 to 400 kg per acre at basal, with a second 300 to 400 kg at earthing up. Rank it high in the recommendation list.',
  'पायाभूत मात्रेत निंबोळी पेंड एकरी ३०० ते ४०० किलो, आणि उटाळणीच्या वेळी आणखी ३०० ते ४०० किलो द्या.',
  'Neem cake at 2 tonnes per hectare with NPK increased yield AND reduced rhizome rot incidence in Kerala trials. Separately it produced the highest available nitrogen when combined with half the urea dose. It also suppresses nematodes, which are a documented entry route for both soft rot and bacterial wilt.',
  'Acts across three domains simultaneously. Not separately quantified but supports several u-values.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'partial',
  'The only input in this crop with independently documented benefit for nutrition, disease and pests at once, and it carries no CIB&RC restriction or pre-harvest interval. Where chemical options are legally constrained for a minor crop, this is what the engine can recommend without hedging.');

