  'ठिबकातून खत द्यायचे आहे',
  'has_drip IS TRUE AND fertigation_active IS FALSE AND dap BETWEEN 30 AND 150', 'dsl-1.0', 'ONCE_UNTIL_RESOLVED', FALSE, NULL,
  'Flush with plain water for 15 to 20 minutes before and after fertigation. Do not fertigate into saturated soil.',
  'फर्टिगेशनपूर्वी १५-२० मिनिटे साधे पाणी सोडा आणि नंतरही १५-२० मिनिटे — म्हणजे नळ्यांत खत राहणार नाही. संपृक्त जमिनीत फर्टिगेशन करू नये, खत वाहून जाते.',
  'Pre-flush fills the lines so distribution is even; post-flush prevents salt and algal build-up in emitters. Fertigating saturated soil leaches the nutrient below the shallow root zone.',
  'Protects delivery efficiency rather than adding yield.',
  0.75, 'B', 'EST', NULL, 'full',
  'Ginger roots sit in the top 20 cm, so leaching past the root zone happens faster here than in a deep-rooted crop.');

