  'Calcium nitrate and phosphoric acid or a sulphate fertiliser scheduled on the same day',
  'कॅल्शिअम नायट्रेट आणि फॉस्फोरिक आम्ल किंवा सल्फेट खत एकाच दिवशी',
  'fertigation_active IS TRUE AND dap BETWEEN 130 AND 140', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Separate them onto different days. Calcium with phosphate or sulphate precipitates and blocks emitters.',
  'कॅल्शिअम आणि स्फुरद किंवा सल्फेट खते एकाच वेळी देऊ नका — अवक्षेपण होते आणि तोट्या तुंबतात. वेगवेगळ्या दिवशी द्या.',
  'Calcium phosphate and calcium sulphate are sparingly soluble and precipitate in the line. The published schedule runs calcium nitrate weekly from 130 DAP while phosphoric acid runs through the 101 to 140 DAP window, so the conflict is real in that overlap.',
  'Prevents equipment damage and interrupted delivery.',
  0.8, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The source does not flag this conflict, but reading the two schedules together shows the overlap. The engine should sequence these automatically rather than expecting the operator to notice.');

