  'Published fertigation schedule about to be applied as printed',
  'प्रकाशित फर्टिगेशन वेळापत्रक जसेच्या तसे वापरले जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Scale it down in proportion to the actual yield target. Total MOP in the printed schedule is about 207 kg per acre, roughly double the Maharashtra official potassium figure.',
  'हे वेळापत्रक जसेच्या तसे वापरू नका. त्यातील एकूण MOP एकरी सुमारे २०७ किलो आहे — म्हणजे अधिकृत शिफारशीच्या जवळपास दुप्पट. आपल्या उत्पादन लक्ष्याच्या प्रमाणात कमी करा.',
  'Fertigation splits nutrients into small frequent doses which raises efficiency, but the printed totals target a higher yield than the validated ceiling for this belt. Nutrient requirement scales with expected yield.',
  'Prevents systematic over-application and unnecessary cost.',
  0.75, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'This is the direct downstream consequence of the yield target correction. The schedule comes from an irrigation equipment supplier whose stated yield gain is 35 to 40 percent, which is higher than the independently sourced figure used for planning.');

