  'Leaf yellowing reported',
  'पाने पिवळी पडली',
  'leaf_yellowing_pattern IS NOT NULL', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Run the diagnosis sequence before recommending any input. Step 1: is the soil at the root wet? Step 2: dig one sample plant. Step 3: which leaves are yellow, old or new? Step 4: check the last three days for temperatures above 35 C. Never recommend urea on the yellowing signal alone.',
  'पिवळी पाने दिसल्यावर पहिली कृती खत नाही — निदान आहे. १) मुळाजवळची माती ओली आहे का. २) एक नमुना रोप उकरून पहा. ३) कोणती पाने पिवळी — जुनी की नवी. ४) गेल्या तीन दिवसांत ३५ अंशांवर तापमान गेले का.',
  'At least six causes produce similar yellowing and the treatments differ. Nitrogen applied to waterlogged soil worsens the condition. Nitrogen applied to lime-induced iron lock-up achieves nothing except foliage growth at the rhizome''s expense.',
  'Prevents wasted input and, more importantly, prevents a missed rot diagnosis worth up to 0.70.',
  0.9, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'partial',
  'The single most frequently triggered diagnostic in this belt, because calcareous yellowing here is expected rather than exceptional.');

