ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

  'NPK probe reading used to set a fertiliser dose',
  'NPK probe च्या वाचनावरून खत मात्रा ठरवली जात आहे',
  'ec_current IS NOT NULL AND soil_test_available IS FALSE', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', FALSE, NULL,
  'REFUSE. The probe infers NPK from electrical conductivity and cannot set doses. Use it for trend, fertigation verification and salt accumulation only. Doses come from the soil test.',
  'NPK probe प्रत्यक्षात NPK मोजत नाही — तो EC मोजून NPK अंदाजतो. त्यावरून खत मात्रा ठरवू नये. त्याचा वापर कल पाहण्यासाठी, फर्टिगेशन पोहोचले का तपासण्यासाठी, आणि क्षार साचण्याच्या इशाऱ्यासाठी. मात्रा माती परीक्षणावरून.',
  'EC is the sum of all dissolved salts. On calcareous alkaline soil the calcium carbonate contribution is large, so the inferred NPK is especially unreliable in this belt. The device measures a real quantity but not the one printed on its label.',
  'Prevents systematic dosing error across the whole season.',
  0.85, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Stating this plainly matters commercially as well as technically. A product that claims NPK sensing and is then tested against a laboratory result will lose credibility. A product that says the probe tracks trend and verifies delivery will not.');

