  'महिमा जातीसाठी प्रयोगात एकरी सुमारे ५१ किलो नत्र, २० किलो स्फुरद आणि ४० किलो पालाश ही मात्रा सर्वाधिक प्रभावी आढळली — म्हणजे स्फुरद कमी, पालाश जास्त.',
  'A 2025 trial on cv. IISR Mahima found 125:50:100 kg per hectare most effective for both vegetative growth and yield. The direction — less phosphorus, more potassium — also suits calcareous soil where phosphorus is fixed.',
  'Directionally supported by a variety-matched trial, which is rare.',
