  'soil_oc_pct below 1.0',
  'सेंद्रिय कर्ब एक टक्क्यापेक्षा कमी',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Set the expectation that raising organic carbon is a three to four season programme. FYM, neem cake and mulch all contribute, and none of them will show the target in one season.',
  'सेंद्रिय कर्ब एका हंगामात वाढत नाही. शेणखत, निंबोळी पेंड आणि आच्छादन यांतून तो तीन-चार हंगामांत वाढतो. ही तूट भरून काढणे दीर्घकालीन काम आहे.',
  'Target is above 1 percent; black soil in this region typically runs 0.3 to 0.5 percent. Organic carbon governs water holding, microbial activity and micronutrient availability, all of which matter more in calcareous heavy soil.',
  'Indirect and cumulative.',
  0.75, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'partial',
  'Setting the expectation honestly matters. A farmer told to reach 1 percent this season concludes the advice failed. Told it is a four-season programme, the same inputs are seen to be working.');

