  'Pest management planning initiated',
  'कीड व्यवस्थापन नियोजन सुरू',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Frame pest control as wound prevention rather than insect killing. Measure success by rot incidence at harvest, not by pest counts.',
  'अद्रकात कीड नियंत्रण म्हणजे गड्ड्याला जखम होऊ न देणे. यश किडीच्या संख्येने नव्हे, काढणीच्या वेळी कंदकुजीच्या प्रमाणाने मोजावे.',
  'Rhizome fly larvae entering the rhizome are followed by pathogenic fungi and nematodes. Nematode wounds are a documented entry route for rot fungi. Shoot borer and white grub both create wounds. The same wounds are created without any pest by careless weeding.',
  'Links the pest u-values to the soft rot u-value of 0.50 to 0.90 rather than treating them as independent.',
  0.88, 'A', 'SRC-D', NULL, 'full',
  'Domain 11 should not add pest and rot u-values as if they were independent. They share a causal chain and adding them separately would double count.');

