  'Start the castor seed bait TODAY. Crush 200 g castor seed into 1.5 litres of water in plastic containers. Explain that it takes 8 to 10 days to develop the smell and the pest arrives in July.',
  'एरंडी आमिष आजच भिजत घाला. प्लॅस्टिकच्या भांड्यात भरडलेले एरंडीचे बी २०० ग्रॅम आणि १.५ लिटर पाणी. ८ ते १० दिवसांनी विशिष्ट वास येऊन कंदमाशा आकर्षित होऊन मरतात — आणि कंदमाशी जुलैत येते, म्हणून आत्ताच सुरुवात करावी लागते.',
  'The bait requires 8 to 10 days to develop the attractant odour. Rhizome fly peaks in July and August. Starting when the pest is seen is already too late.',
  'Primary control for the pest carrying u = 0.175, with no regulatory constraint and negligible cost.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-Q', 0.175, 'none',
  'This is exactly what an advisory engine is for. The farmer may already know the method; what is hard is remembering it ten days before the pest arrives, with the reason attached.');

