  'Nematodes suck root sap, so growth is stunted and tiller number falls. Mahima is expected to produce 12 to 13 tillers per plant, so a shortfall against the variety norm is measurable. The symptom set overlaps with nitrogen deficiency, which is why the nitrogen record is part of the trigger.',
