  'Intercrop selection includes chilli, brinjal, tomato or potato',
  'आंतरपीक म्हणून मिरची, वांगी, टोमॅटो किंवा बटाटा निवडले जात आहे',
  'intercrop_selected IN [chilli, brinjal, tomato, potato]', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', FALSE, NULL,
  'REFUSE these as intercrops. They are hosts for bacterial wilt, which is the disease with no reliable cure in this crop.',
  'मिरची, वांगी, टोमॅटो, बटाटा हे आंतरपीक म्हणूनही घेऊ नयेत. ती मर रोगाची यजमान पिके आहेत, आणि मर रोगावर खात्रीशीर उपाय नाही. फेरपालटीत टाळायचे पीक आंतरपीक म्हणूनही टाळावे — कारण ते तर तात्काळ शेजारीच असते.',
  'One source lists chilli among recommended intercrops, but chilli is a solanaceous host for Ralstonia. A crop excluded from the rotation for disease reasons cannot be acceptable as an intercrop, where it sits immediately adjacent all season.',
  'Prevents exposure to the 0.30 to 0.70 bacterial wilt pathway.',
  0.85, 'A', 'DERIVED', 0.5, 'none',
  'This correction was found by cross checking the intercrop list against the disease host list. It is the kind of contradiction that only appears when domains are validated against each other rather than written in isolation.');

