  'A wilting or yellowing plant is reported at any stage',
  'कोणत्याही अवस्थेत कोमेजलेले किंवा पिवळे रोप नोंदवले',
  'leaf_yellowing_pattern IS NOT NULL OR wilt_while_green IS TRUE OR central_shoot_dead IS TRUE', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Do NOT recommend any fungicide yet. Ask two questions first: did the leaves stay green while the plant wilted, and is the central shoot dead? Then require the stem-cut test and the ooze test. Diagnosis precedes treatment without exception.',
  'अजून कोणतेही बुरशीनाशक सुचवू नका. आधी दोन प्रश्न — पाने हिरवीच असताना कोमेजली का, आणि सुरळी मेली आहे का. मग खोड कापण्याची चाचणी आणि स्राव चाचणी करा. निदान झाल्याशिवाय उपचार नाही.',
  'Soft rot, bacterial wilt and fusarium yellows produce almost identical above-ground symptoms. The source states explicitly that they can be confused but can be distinguished on careful examination. Treatments differ completely and one of the three responds to no fungicide at all.',
  'Prevents the entire cost of a wrong treatment plus continued spread. Misdiagnosis of bacterial wilt as soft rot wastes the full input cost while the pathogen advances.',
  0.9, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'partial',
  'The single most practically useful rule in the knowledge base for this belt. The tests need a knife and a glass of water. Nothing else in Domain 6 saves as much money for as little effort.');

