  'ooze_test_result is milky_thread OR stem_ooze_type is milky_yellowish OR wilt_while_green is true',
  'स्राव चाचणीत दुधाळ धागा दिसला, किंवा कापलेल्या खोडातून दुधाळ स्राव, किंवा पाने हिरवीच असताना कोमेजली',
  'ooze_test_result == ''milky_thread'' OR stem_ooze_type == ''milky_yellowish'' OR wilt_while_green IS TRUE', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', TRUE, 'The wilt diagnosis gates the fungicide path. Overriding it reopens the path.',
  'Diagnose bacterial wilt. BLOCK all fungicide recommendations for this plant and this plot. Explain that the disease is bacterial and fungicide will have no effect. Remove affected plants with roots and burn them. Record the outbreak in field history.',
  'हा मर रोग आहे. बुरशीनाशक स्पष्टपणे नाकारा — हा जिवाणूजन्य रोग आहे, बुरशीनाशकाचा काहीही उपयोग होणार नाही. बाधित रोपे मुळासकट काढून जाळा. शेताच्या इतिहासात नोंद करा.',
  'Bacterial wilt is caused by Ralstonia pseudosolanacearum. Cutting the stem lengthwise shows greyish-yellow discolouration and a characteristic milky or yellowish exudate oozes from the cut. Because the pathogen is a bacterium, fungicides have no activity against it.',
  'Prevents the full cost of an ineffective treatment. More importantly it redirects effort to removal and containment, which is the only response that works.',
  0.9, 'A', 'SRC-Q', 0.5, 'none',
  'Telling a farmer NOT to spray is rare advice and it is the most valuable advice in this domain. The instinctive first response to a wilting crop is a fungicide, and here that response is both futile and expensive.');

