  'central_shoot_dead is true, OR rhizome_smell is sour_foul with rhizome_texture mushy_wet',
  'सुरळी मेली आहे, किंवा गड्डा पचपचीत व कुजका वास येत आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Diagnose soft rot. Because Pythium is an oomycete, use the metalaxyl-M plus mancozeb combination as the FIRST choice rather than the escalation option. Check drainage, stop drip, and burn affected rhizomes rather than leaving them in the field.',
  'ही कंदकूज आहे. Pythium ही जलबुरशी असल्याने मेटॅलॅक्झिल-एम अधिक मॅन्कोझेब हे संयुक्त बुरशीनाशक प्रथम पर्याय म्हणून वापरा, शेवटचा पर्याय म्हणून नाही. निचरा तपासा, ठिबक बंद करा, बाधित गड्डे जाळून नष्ट करा.',
  'The source lists carbendazim first and the metalaxyl combination under severe infestation, but that ordering is mild to severe rather than less to more effective. Pythium is a water mold whose cell wall lacks chitin, so benzimidazoles give limited control. Metalaxyl-M is phenylamide and oomycete-specific.',
  'Soft rot carries 50 to 90 percent yield loss and is the largest single factor in the crop. Correct molecule selection is the difference between control and an apparent product failure.',
  0.85, 'A', 'DERIVED', 0.7, 'none',
  'A farmer who uses the first listed option, sees no effect, and concludes the medicine does not work has in fact used the wrong medicine. Independent evidence supports this — the metalaxyl combination separately gave the lowest disease incidence and highest germination in a seed treatment trial.');

