  'rhizome_texture is dry_rot AND progression is slow AND no milky ooze',
  'गड्ड्याचा कूज कोरडा आहे, प्रगती मंद, दुधाळ स्राव नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Diagnose fusarium yellows. Ordinary fungicides are effective here, unlike the other two. Treat as the third-ranked risk and rely on the shared preventive stack rather than a separate programme.',
  'हा फ्युजेरियम पिवळेपणा असू शकतो. यावर सामान्य बुरशीनाशके चालतात — इतर दोन रोगांप्रमाणे नाही. हा तिसऱ्या क्रमांकाचा धोका मानावा; कंदकुजीचे प्रतिबंधक उपाय यावरही काम करतात.',
  'Fusarium oxysporum f. sp. zingiberi is a true fungus, so benzimidazole and triazole chemistry works. It produces a dry rot and progresses slowly, in contrast to the wet mushy rot and rapid progression of Pythium.',
  'Third-ranked risk. Correct identification mainly prevents the unnecessary use of oomycete-specific chemistry.',
  0.75, 'A', 'SRC-D', NULL, 'partial',
  'Limited Indian and Maharashtra-specific detail was located for this disease. It stays in the diagnostic table because excluding it would push its cases into the other two categories, but it does not need its own preventive programme.');

