  'Leaf spots reported AND air_temp_max_c above 35 in the preceding three days',
  'पानांवर ठिपके दिसले आणि गेल्या तीन दिवसांत तापमान ३५ अंशांवर होते',
  'leaf_spot_rings_visible IS NOT NULL AND air_temp_max_c > 35', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Before treating as disease, hold a leaf up to the sun and look for concentric rings inside the spots. Rings mean leaf spot. No rings, with scorched tips and margins on exposed leaves, means heat damage — treat with mulch, shade and irrigation timing, not fungicide.',
  'उपचारापूर्वी पान सूर्याकडे धरून पहा. ठिपक्यांमध्ये अनेक वर्तुळे दिसली तर तो करपा रोग. वर्तुळे नाहीत आणि उघड्या पानांच्या टोकांना व कडांना करपा असेल तर ती उष्णतेची इजा — त्यावर आच्छादन, सावली आणि पाण्याची वेळ, बुरशीनाशक नाही.',
  'The source gives the sun-held ring test as the diagnostic sign for leaf spot. In this district recorded maxima reach 45.9 C and leaves scorch above 35 C, so heat damage to foliage is routine rather than exceptional and will otherwise be misread as disease.',
  'Prevents unnecessary fungicide use. Leaf spot itself carries roughly 0.08.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-Q', 0.08, 'partial',
  'Without this test the engine would recommend fungicide repeatedly through May and June for what is simply sun damage. The test costs nothing and needs no equipment.');

