  'Saturation exceeded 12 hours OR humidity above 85 percent for three consecutive days, in August or September, at stage G2 or G3',
  'पाणी १२ तासांहून जास्त साचले, किंवा सलग तीन दिवस आर्द्रता ८५ टक्क्यांवर, ऑगस्ट-सप्टेंबरमध्ये, पीक G2 किंवा G3 अवस्थेत',
  '(DURATION(soil_moisture_vwc > vwc_saturation) > 12 HOURS OR DURATION(rh_pct > 85) > 72 HOURS) AND MONTH IN [AUG, SEP] AND STAGE IN [G2, G3]', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Start the preventive protocol WITHOUT waiting for symptoms. Check all three drainage levels, stop drip, apply Trichoderma drench, and where risk is high apply a preventive metalaxyl plus mancozeb drench.',
  'लक्षणांची वाट न पाहता कंदकूज प्रतिबंधक कृती सुरू करा. निचऱ्याच्या तिन्ही पातळ्या तपासा, ठिबक बंद करा, ट्रायकोडर्मा आळवणी करा, आणि जोखीम जास्त असल्यास प्रतिबंधात्मक बुरशीनाशक आळवणी करा.',
  'For a disease flagged not curable, symptom appearance means the yield is already lost. When leaves yellow and the shoot collapses, the rhizome is already rotten. The environmental signature that precedes infection is therefore the correct trigger, and a high false positive rate is the price of prevention.',
  'Soft rot carries 50 to 90 percent loss. Ten false alarms cost ten drainage inspections; one missed true alarm costs most of the crop.',
  0.88, 'A', 'SRC-D', 0.7, 'none',
  'The timing here is unforgiving. July delivers about 195 mm, the wettest month, soft rot peaks in August and September, and G3 is when rhizome fingers differentiate irreversibly. All three coincide.');

