  'Soft rot confirmed on any plant',
  'कोणत्याही रोपावर कंदकूज निश्चित झाली',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Remove affected plants with roots and burn them. Do not leave them in the field or on the bund. Drench the affected and adjacent beds. Drench only when the soil is at vafsa condition and give a light water stress afterwards.',
  'बाधित रोपे मुळासकट काढून जाळून नष्ट करा — शेतात किंवा बांधावर टाकू नका. बाधित व शेजारच्या वाफ्यांत आळवणी करा. आळवणी करताना जमिनीस वाफसा असावा, आणि नंतर पिकास थोडासा पाण्याचा ताण द्यावा.',
  'Affected rhizomes left in the field become inoculum for the rest of the season and for subsequent seasons. Drenching saturated soil dilutes and displaces the chemical, and irrigating immediately afterwards leaches it below the shallow root zone.',
  'Limits spread within the season and reduces carry-over inoculum.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'partial',
  'The water stress instruction creates a cross-domain dependency. The engine must reduce drip for three to five days after a drench, which a human operator would easily overlook.');

