  'Any field operation involving soil disturbance near the rhizome is scheduled',
  'गड्ड्याजवळ माती हलवण्याचे कोणतेही काम ठरले आहे',
  'earthing_up_date IS NULL AND dap BETWEEN 70 AND 95', 'dsl-1.0', 'WINDOW', FALSE, NULL,
  'Instruct that the rhizome must not be injured during weeding, earthing up or harvest. Mechanical injury opens the same entry route as any pest, with no pest involved.',
  'खुरपणी, उटाळणी किंवा काढणी करताना गड्ड्याला इजा होणार नाही याची काळजी घ्या. यांत्रिक इजा हीसुद्धा किडीसारखीच जखम आहे, आणि तिच्यातूनही पिथियम व फ्युजेरियम आत शिरतात.',
  'The source states that injury to the rhizome during earthing up or weeding allows Pythium and Fusarium to enter. This is a pathogen entry route that requires no insect at all, and it originates in the operations the farmer performs deliberately.',
  'Prevents entry into the 0.50 to 0.90 pathway at zero input cost.',
  0.88, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'Zero cost. It is an instruction to the labour team rather than a purchase, and it belongs in the day task list beside the operation itself rather than in a separate advisory.');

