  'field_history_wilt is true for this plot and the persistence window has not elapsed',
  'या प्लॉटवर मर रोगाची नोंद आहे आणि पुरेशी वर्षे उलटलेली नाहीत',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Warn clearly before replanting ginger or turmeric here. The bacterium persists in soil for many years. Recommend a different plot if one is available, and treat the standard three-year rotation as insufficient where wilt has actually been recorded.',
  'या प्लॉटवर मर रोग नोंदवलेला आहे. हा जिवाणू जमिनीत अनेक वर्षे टिकतो. दुसरा प्लॉट उपलब्ध असल्यास तो निवडा. जिथे प्रत्यक्ष मर रोग आढळला आहे तिथे तीन वर्षांची फेरपालट पुरेशी मानू नये.',
  'Ralstonia is described as notorious for persisting in soil for many years and has a wide host range. Management strategies have met with limited success and it remains an enigma, so there is no reliable curative response once the crop is planted into infested soil.',
  'Prevents exposure to a 0.30 to 0.70 loss with no available treatment.',
  0.9, 'A', 'SRC-D', 0.5, 'none',
  'This rule depends entirely on a field history record surviving across years, which paper does not do and farmer memory does incompletely. Holding that record is the clearest durable advantage the product has, and it grows more valuable the longer it runs.');

