  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Apply the due mulch stage. Treat the three-stage programme as disease control, not as moisture conservation. Bundle stage two with earthing up.',
  'आच्छादनाचा टप्पा घाला. तीन-टप्पी आच्छादन हे ओलावा टिकवण्याचे साधन नाही — ते रोग-प्रतिबंधाचे मुख्य साधन आहे. दुसरा टप्पा उटाळणीसोबत करा.',
  'Records from Kodagu and Shivamogga show soft rot below 5 percent among farmers following a three-stage mulching programme against a district average of 20 to 30 percent. Mulch lowers soil temperature, stops rain impact compaction, prevents splash carrying soil onto leaves, and keeps moisture steady so the plant is less stressed.',
  'u = 0.20, derived from 25 percent average incidence reduced to 5 percent. This is the best quantified preventive measure in the knowledge base.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-Q', 0.2, 'none',
  'This is the strongest numerical evidence for any single preventive here, and it belongs to Domain 6 rather than to cultivation operations. It is also missing from the standard per-acre cost sheet, which is why the Kannad budget had to add roughly Rs 15,000 for it.');

