  'Pre-season planning is initiated',
  'हंगामापूर्व नियोजन सुरू',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Issue the full prevention checklist in Kannad priority order: drainage first, then three-stage mulching, then Mahima with healthy seed, then planting by 7 June, then solarization, then Trichoderma with neem cake.',
  'प्रतिबंधक यादी प्राधान्यक्रमाने द्या — प्रथम निचरा, मग तीन-टप्पी आच्छादन, मग महिमा जात व निरोगी बेणे, मग ७ जूनपर्यंत लागवड, मग सौरीकरण, मग ट्रायकोडर्मा व निंबोळी पेंड.',
  'Sixteen preventive measures are documented and six of them are entirely free. All are decisions taken before or at planting, which means the largest part of disease management is complete before the crop is in the ground. After that point soft rot and bacterial wilt offer no cure, only damage limitation.',
  'The stack collectively addresses the largest loss factor in the crop. Individual u-values range from 0.05 to 0.22.',
  0.85, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'none',
  'Six of sixteen measures are free and all sixteen are pre-plant. This is the numerical case for the advisory engine starting sixty days before planting rather than at sowing, which was the reason Core C13.7 introduced a pre-season stage at all.');

