  'previous_crops_3yr contains ginger, turmeric, potato, tomato, brinjal or chilli',
  'मागील तीन वर्षांत आले, हळद, बटाटा, टोमॅटो, वांगी किंवा मिरची घेतलेली आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Warn that rotation is not satisfied. Ginger and turmeric share soil-borne pathogens; the solanaceous crops are bacterial wilt hosts. Recommend a different plot where available.',
  'फेरपालट पाळलेली नाही. हळद व आले एकाच कुळातील असल्याने त्यांचे soil-borne रोग सामाईक आहेत; बटाटा, टोमॅटो, वांगी, मिरची हे मर रोगाचे यजमान आहेत.',
  'Continuous cropping raises the risk of infection by both Pythium myriotylum and Ralstonia solanacearum. The minimum recommended gap is three years, and the wilt bacterium can persist longer than that.',
  'u = 0.15 for rotation failure alone, substantially higher if a wilt outbreak follows.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-D', 0.15, 'none',
  'This also excludes those crops as intercrops, not only as predecessors. An intercrop sits immediately adjacent for the whole season, which is a shorter distance than a previous season.');

