  'A fungicide is about to be emitted for a plant diagnosed with bacterial wilt',
  'मर रोगाचे निदान झालेल्या रोपासाठी बुरशीनाशक सुचवले जात आहे',
  'ooze_test_result == ''milky_thread'' OR stem_ooze_type == ''milky_yellowish'' OR wilt_while_green IS TRUE', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', TRUE, 'No fungicide has activity against a bacterium. Offering one wastes money while the pathogen spreads.',
  'BLOCK. No fungicide has activity against a bacterial pathogen. Emit removal, containment and rotation guidance instead, and state the reason plainly.',
  'नाकारा. जिवाणूजन्य रोगावर कोणतेही बुरशीनाशक चालत नाही. त्याऐवजी रोपे काढून जाळणे, प्रसार रोखणे आणि फेरपालट यांचा सल्ला द्या, आणि कारण स्पष्ट सांगा.',
  'Bacterial wilt is caused by a bacterium. Fungicides act on fungal or oomycete targets that a bacterium does not possess. The deliberate absence of any bacterial_wilt entry in the fungicide table encodes this at the data level rather than relying on rule logic alone.',
  'Prevents wasted expenditure and, more importantly, prevents the delay during which the pathogen continues to spread.',
  0.92, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Encoded twice on purpose — once as this rule and once as the absence of an entry in the fungicide table. A data-level guarantee is stronger than a rule that someone can later bypass.');

