  'air_temp_max_c > 35 AND STAGE IN [G0, G1]', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Escalate heat protection. Confirm stage one mulch is in place, split drip into morning and evening runs, and do not irrigate at midday. Mulch here is a precondition for emergence, not a moisture-saving extra.',
  'उष्णता संरक्षण वाढवा. आच्छादन घातले आहे का तपासा, ठिबक सकाळ-संध्याकाळ दोन पाळ्यांत चालवा, दुपारी पाणी देऊ नका. इथे आच्छादन हे ओलावा टिकवण्याचे साधन नाही — ते उगवणीची अट आहे.',
  'Germination needs a soil temperature of 25 to 26 C. May mean daily maximum is 39.8 C and the recorded maximum is 45.9 C, and bare black soil runs hotter than air. Leaves scorch above 35 C. EXPERT AMENDMENT: threshold lowered from 38 C to 35 C, matching D01-TM-001.',
  'u = 0.12 estimated for absent stage one mulch under heat stress. Establishment is a hard ceiling, so the loss is irrecoverable.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-D', 0.12, 'none',
  'This is the one genuine climate mismatch in the whole season and it lands on the planting month. Concentrating all protective effort into these five weeks is more effective than spreading it thin across eight months.');

