  'Leaf tip and margin scorch reported AND air_temp_max_c above 35 in the preceding three days',
  'पानांच्या टोकांना व कडांना करपा दिसला आणि गेल्या तीन दिवसांत तापमान ३५ अंशांवर होते',
  'heat_stress_days_count >= 3 AND STAGE IN [G1, G2, G3]', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Classify as heat stress, not disease. Recommend mulch, shade and irrigation timing. Do not recommend a fungicide on this signal.',
  'ही उष्णतेची इजा आहे, रोग नाही. आच्छादन, सावली आणि पाण्याची वेळ हे उपाय. बुरशीनाशक सुचवू नका.',
  'Leaves scorch above 35 C, and in this district maxima reach 45.9 C, so foliage scorch is routine rather than exceptional. Without the weather record it is indistinguishable from leaf spot, and the source''s sun-held ring test is the confirming check.',
  'Prevents repeated unnecessary fungicide application through the hot months.',
  0.8, 'A', 'SRC-D', NULL, 'partial',
  'In a belt this hot, misreading heat scorch as disease would produce a fungicide recommendation every few weeks in summer. The weather record is what makes the distinction possible.');

