  'Month is October AND stage is G3 or G4',
  'ऑक्टोबर महिना आणि पीक G3 किंवा G4 अवस्थेत',
  'MONTH IN [OCT] AND heat_stress_days_count >= 3', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Raise vigilance. October carries three pressures at once — a secondary temperature maximum, peak water demand at 22,000 litres per acre per day, and the cyclone window.',
  'ऑक्टोबरमध्ये दक्षता वाढवा. या महिन्यात तीन गोष्टी एकत्र येतात — दिवसाच्या तापमानाचा दुय्यम शिखर, पाण्याची सर्वाधिक मागणी, आणि चक्रीवादळाची शक्यता.',
  'The gazetteer records that day temperature rises again after monsoon withdrawal, giving a secondary October maximum. The Domain 3 water table peaks in September and October. The cyclone season has a post-monsoon peak in October and November.',
  'Not a separate factor. It concentrates existing risks into one month at the highest criticality stage.',
  0.75, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'partial',
  'October is the second stress point of the season after May, and unlike May it arrives when the whole season''s investment is already committed.');

