  'Month is between November and January AND stage is G4',
  'नोव्हेंबर ते जानेवारी आणि पीक गड्डा भरण्याच्या अवस्थेत',
  'air_temp_min_c < 12 AND STAGE IN [G4]', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Inform that conditions are now favourable and the priority shifts from protection to supply — consistent moisture and potassium. This is when yield is actually made.',
  'आता तापमान गड्डा भरण्यासाठी अनुकूल आहे. आता पीक वाचवण्यापेक्षा भरू देणे महत्वाचे — ओलाव्यात सातत्य आणि पालाश. उत्पादन याच काळात ठरते.',
  'Rhizome growth optimum is 18 to 20 C and the December mean here is 20.8 C. Kerala and Konkan do not have this because their winters stay warm. The dryness and the cold winter come from the same geography.',
  'Identifies the window in which the largest share of yield accumulates.',
  0.82, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'full',
  'The whole season compresses to: May and June defend against heat, July to September defend against water, October to January let the crop fill. Yield is made in the third phase, but only if the first two are survived.');

