  'dry_spell_days at or above 7 AND stage is G3 or G4',
  'पावसाचा खंड सात दिवस आणि पीक गड्डा तयार होण्याच्या किंवा भरण्याच्या अवस्थेत',
  'dry_spell_days >= 7 AND STAGE IN [G3, G4]', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Resume full irrigation at 7 days rather than waiting for the general 10 to 12 day rule. In G3 and G4 a ten day gap is already too long.',
  'या अवस्थांत १० ते १२ दिवसांची वाट पाहू नका — सात दिवसांवरच पूर्ण क्षमतेने ठिबक सुरू करा. G3 मध्ये दहा दिवस खूप जास्त आहेत.',
  'Dry spells of 20 to 45 days have been recorded across Maharashtra with Marathwada worse than average, and pulse yields in Latur fell 40 to 60 percent in one such event. The general 10 to 12 day intervention rule is a floor for average conditions, not a description of this belt.',
  'u = 0.20 for stress in the critical window, and it is irrecoverable because fingers that fail to differentiate do not form later.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-D', 0.2, 'none',
  'The recorded 20 to 45 day spells are what make drip a precondition rather than an efficiency measure. Without it, a single average dry spell at G3 ends the season.');

