  'Month is October or November AND forecast_rain_48h_mm above 40',
  'ऑक्टोबर किंवा नोव्हेंबर, ४८ तासांत ४० मिमीहून जास्त पावसाचा अंदाज',
  'MONTH IN [OCT, NOV] AND forecast_rain_48h_mm > 40', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Raise a red drainage alert, more severe than the equivalent monsoon warning. Stop drip, clear channels urgently, and check saturation within 12 hours of the rain stopping.',
  'लाल इशारा — आणि हा जुलैच्या इशाऱ्यापेक्षा जास्त तीव्र. ठिबक बंद करा, निचरा चर तातडीने मोकळे करा, पाऊस थांबल्यावर बारा तासांत संपृक्तता तपासा.',
  'The district lies in the path of tropical cyclones with a post-monsoon intensity peak in October and November. It is not struck at full intensity but can receive heavy rainfall. By then the rhizome is fully formed, the soil has been dry and cracked for weeks, and drainage channels have usually been neglected because the monsoon is considered over.',
  'u = 0.20 to 0.40, and more expensive than an equivalent July event because the entire season investment is already committed.',
  0.75, 'B', 'SRC-D', 0.3, 'none',
  'Neither Domain 3 nor Domain 6 contained this rule when they were first written. Both assumed the rainy season ends in September. It surfaced only when the climate profile was examined in its own right, which is an argument for having a weather domain rather than scattering weather facts through the others.');

