  'सलग तीन दिवस आर्द्रता ८५ टक्क्यांवर, ऑगस्ट किंवा सप्टेंबर',
  'DURATION(rh_pct > 85) > 72 HOURS AND MONTH IN [AUG, SEP]', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Trigger the soil-borne disease protocol. August is the highest humidity month here and it coincides with the soft rot peak.',
  'कंदकूज प्रतिबंधक कृती सुरू करा. इथे ऑगस्टमध्ये सर्वाधिक आर्द्रता असते आणि तोच कंदकुजीचा शिखर काळ आहे.',
  'August records the highest relative humidity in this district and soft rot peaks in August and September. The coincidence is causal rather than accidental — high humidity is one of the conditions the pathogen requires.',
  'Feeds the 0.70 soft rot pathway.',
  0.82, 'A', 'SRC-D', NULL, 'partial',
  'One of two distinct disease seasons here. The other is winter fog driving foliar disease, and the two need different responses at different times of year.');

