  'Estimated leaf_wetness_hours above 8 for two consecutive days AND month between December and February',
  'पानांवरील अंदाजित ओलावा आठ तासांहून जास्त सलग दोन दिवस, डिसेंबर ते फेब्रुवारी',
  'leaf_wetness_hours > 8 AND MONTH IN [DEC, JAN, FEB]', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Trigger the foliar disease schedule. This is the second disease season, driven by winter fog rather than by soil saturation.',
  'पानांवरील रोगाचे वेळापत्रक सुरू करा. हा दुसरा रोग-हंगाम आहे — जमिनीतील ओलाव्यामुळे नव्हे, हिवाळी धुक्यामुळे.',
  'Leaf spot and blotch depend on the duration of surface wetness, and the source''s fog rule is a qualitative version of the same relationship. Leaf wetness must be estimated from humidity, temperature and dew point because no dedicated sensor is fitted.',
  'Leaf spot carries roughly 0.08.',
