  'Record the leaf wetness sensor as the highest value missing measurement, followed by solar radiation if not already fitted. Both are cheap.',
  'पानांवरील ओलावा मोजणारा sensor हा सर्वात मूल्यवान गहाळ मापन आहे; त्यानंतर सौर विकिरण. दोन्ही स्वस्त आहेत.',
  'Leaf wetness duration drives foliar disease and is currently estimated rather than measured. Solar radiation improves the evaporation computation where no pan is fitted.',
