  'Long range monsoon forecasting is IMD''s work and has real limits. Overstating capability fails at the first dry spell that was not predicted. The genuine contribution is the third element — IMD reports weather but does not say what the crop should do.',
  'None. Protects credibility, which is a precondition for the advice being followed at all.',
