  'Compute seed requirement from area, spacing and piece weight rather than using a rule of thumb. Show the calculation. A wrong assumption here moves the largest cost line in the crop.',
  'बेण्याचे प्रमाण गृहीत धरून सांगू नका — क्षेत्र, अंतर आणि तुकड्याचे वजन यावरून गणित करून दाखवा. इथली चूक सर्वात मोठ्या खर्च रेषेवर परिणाम करते.',
  'Reported seed rates and computed plant populations do not reconcile. At 850 kg per acre and 35 g per piece the count is about 24,300 per acre, roughly 60,000 per hectare, against a computed broad ridge population of about 111,000 per hectare. Either the rate is higher than reported, the spacing is wider in practice, or the pieces are lighter.',
  'Seed is 28 to 35 percent of total cost. A factor-of-two error in the estimate is the single largest budgeting error available.',
  0.7, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'This reconciliation must be settled by counting in season one. It is flagged rather than resolved because the sources genuinely disagree and guessing would put a wrong number into the biggest line of the budget.');

