  'Seed rhizome is being put into storage',
  'बेणे साठवणीत ठेवले जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Warn that 28 to 40 percent of the weight will be lost by planting time. To have a given quantity at planting, store roughly 1.4 times that amount. Record both weights.',
  'साठवणीत बेण्याचे वजन २८ ते ४०% घटते. लागवडीच्या वेळी जेवढे हवे आहे त्याच्या सुमारे १.४ पट आत्ता साठवावे लागेल. साठवणीचे आणि लागवडीच्या वेळचे — दोन्ही वजन नोंदवा.',
  'Source states that 25 quintal per hectare is required at planting but by then the stored weight has fallen to 15 to 18 quintal. A separate statement in the same source gives 25 to 30 percent loss for simple shade storage, so the range is internally consistent.',
  'Not a yield factor. It is a cost of roughly half the seed line again, paid in kind rather than in cash, and therefore invisible in every cost sheet.',
  0.78, 'C', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'partial',
  'This directly challenges the assumption that retaining own seed is cheaper. The loss is real but invisible, so it never enters the comparison. Two weighings — one at storage, one at planting — settle it for this plot.');

