  'Planting day AND bud_orientation_instructed is false',
  'लागवडीचा दिवस, डोळ्याच्या दिशेबद्दल सूचना दिलेली नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Instruct the planting team that the bud must face UP and OUTWARD. A bud facing down and inward produces a small weak shoot.',
  'मजुरांना स्पष्ट सूचना द्या — कंदावरील डोळा वरती आणि बाहेरच्या बाजूला असावा. डोळा खाली आणि आतल्या बाजूला राहिल्यास कोंब लहान आणि कमकुवत राहतो.',
  'Source states that when the bud faces up and outward the emerging shoot is strong and grows well, and that the reverse orientation gives a small weak shoot. A weak shoot means fewer tillers, and tiller count sets rhizome number.',
  'u = 0.05. Small individually but entirely free, and it compounds across every plant in the field.',
  0.72, 'C', 'SRC-D', 0.05, 'none',
  'Zero cost and easily lost, because on planting day the priority is speed. A diagram in the day''s instruction list works better than a sentence.');

