  'Planting in progress',
  'लागवड सुरू आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Plant at 4 to 5 cm depth and confirm the rhizome is fully covered. Too shallow exposes it to heat and to rhizome fly; too deep delays emergence.',
  '४ ते ५ सेंमी खोलीवर लावा आणि गड्डा पूर्ण झाकला जाईल याची खात्री करा. उथळ लावल्यास उष्णता आणि कंदमाशीचा धोका; खोल लावल्यास उगवण लांबते.',
  'Source specifies 4 to 5 cm with the instruction to ensure full covering. Exposed rhizomes are the documented entry route for rhizome fly, which is the primary pest here.',
  'u = 0.05 estimated. Also feeds the rhizome fly pathway.',
  0.75, 'C', 'SRC-Q', 0.05, 'none',
  'Full covering matters more here than in cooler belts, because bare black soil in May runs well above the 25 to 26 C germination optimum and an exposed piece bakes.');

