ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

  'Herbicide proposed AND (emergence_started is true OR dap at or above 15)',
  'तणनाशकाचा प्रस्ताव, पण अद्रक उगवू लागले आहे किंवा १५ दिवस झाले आहेत',
  '(emergence_started IS TRUE OR dap >= 15) AND herbicide_post_emergent_date IS NULL', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', FALSE, NULL,
  'BLOCK all herbicide. Glyphosate is non-selective and will kill emerged ginger. From here on, weed control is manual weeding and mulch only.',
  'कोणतेही तणनाशक वापरू नका. ग्लायफोसेट अनिवडक आहे — ते उगवलेल्या अद्रकालाही मारते. यापुढे तण नियंत्रण फक्त खुरपणी आणि आच्छादनाने.',
  'Source instructs that herbicide be avoided once emergence begins. Ginger emerges at 15 to 25 DAP while the second herbicide application falls at 12 to 15 DAP, so the two nearly coincide and the margin for error is a few days.',
  'Prevents catastrophic crop loss rather than a proportional one.',
  0.88, 'C', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'The whole herbicide window is 15 days long and the closing edge sits right next to emergence. This is the one place in the domain where a timing error destroys the crop rather than reducing it.');

