  'Manual weeding scheduled',
  'खुरपणी ठरली आहे',
  'dap BETWEEN 25 AND 60 AND weeding_count < 2', 'dsl-1.0', 'WINDOW', FALSE, NULL,
  'Instruct that the rhizome must not be injured. Keep the field weed free for the first four to six weeks; three to four weedings across the season depending on pressure.',
  'खुरपणी करताना गड्ड्याला इजा होणार नाही याची काळजी घ्या. पहिले चार ते सहा आठवडे शेत तणविरहित ठेवा; हंगामभर तणाच्या तीव्रतेनुसार तीन ते चार खुरपण्या.',
  'Injury during weeding allows Pythium and Fusarium to enter. Because heavy FYM raises weed pressure, ginger needs more weeding than most crops, which raises the injury exposure proportionally.',
  'Prevents entry into the 0.50 to 0.90 rot pathway at zero cost.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'The causal chain runs from FYM to weed seed to more weeding to rhizome injury to rot. Fully decomposed FYM breaks it at the first link, which is why that one condition serves three domains.');

