  'Land preparation phase AND perennial_weeds_removed is false',
  'पूर्वमशागत सुरू, बहुवार्षिक तणांचे कंद काढलेले नाहीत',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Physically remove perennial weed tubers and rhizomes — nutsedge, bermuda grass and kunda — along with stones. Do not rely on later weeding.',
  'लव्हाळा, हराळी, कुंदा यांचे कंद व काश्या वेचून काढा, तसेच दगड. नंतरच्या खुरपणीवर विसंबून राहू नये.',
  'Ginger emerges slowly and cannot outcompete established perennial weeds. More importantly, controlling them later means heavy weeding around a developing rhizome, which is the injury route into rot.',
  'Acts through the disease pathway rather than through competition alone.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-D', NULL, 'none',
  'Doing this two months before planting is a disease prevention operation, not a tidiness one. The sources name the three species, which makes the instruction specific enough to act on.');

