  'Planting completed AND mulch_stage_1_done is false',
  'लागवड झाली पण आच्छादन घातलेले नाही',
  'dap BETWEEN 0 AND 4 AND mulch_stage_1_done IS FALSE', 'dsl-1.0', 'WINDOW', FALSE, NULL,
  'Apply mulch immediately, the same day. This is a precondition for emergence in this belt, not a moisture-saving improvement.',
  'लागवडीच्या दिवशीच आच्छादन घाला. इथे ते ओलावा टिकवण्याची सुधारणा नाही — उगवणीची अट आहे.',
  'Germination needs a soil temperature of 25 to 26 C while May maxima here reach 45.9 C and bare black soil runs hotter than air. Mulch is the only practical way to bring the surface temperature into range. It also carries the largest documented disease benefit of any single operation.',
  'u = 0.20 across the full three-stage programme, with the disease effect being the largest component.',
  0.85, 'B', 'SRC-Q', 0.2, 'none',
  'Mulch appears in five domains — water, disease, weeds, temperature and organic carbon. Nothing else in this knowledge base does that, and it is absent from the standard per-acre cost sheet, which is why roughly Rs 15,000 had to be added to the Kannad budget.');

