  'dap between 75 and 90 AND earthing_up_date is empty',
  '७५ ते ९० दिवस, उटाळणी झालेली नाही',
  'dap BETWEEN 75 AND 90 AND earthing_up_date IS NULL AND flowering_observed IS FALSE', 'dsl-1.0', 'WINDOW', FALSE, NULL,
  'Carry out earthing up now with a long-handled khurpa. Bundle with weeding, covering exposed rhizomes, the final nitrogen split, neem cake and mulch stage two. Skipping earthing up costs 10 to 15 percent yield.',
  'आत्ता लांब दांड्याच्या खुरप्याने उटाळणी करा. सोबतच खुरपणी, उघडे गड्डे झाकणे, नत्राचा शेवटचा हप्ता, निंबोळी पेंड आणि आच्छादनाचा दुसरा टप्पा — सर्व एकाच फेरीत. उटाळणी न केल्यास उत्पादनात १० ते १५% घट.',
  'Moving the soil breaks old roots and new fibrous roots emerge in their place, and the soil becomes friable so the rhizome has room to expand laterally. It must precede the flowering spike, after which assimilate shifts from foliage to rhizome and there is no time to build new roots.',
  'u = 0.125. Two institutional-grade sources agree on 10 to 15 percent; a third gives 15 to 20 percent and is not used.',
  0.88, 'A', 'SRC-Q', 0.125, 'none',
  'This is the most important field day of the season — six operations from five domains in one visit. Preparation must start a week ahead so labour, fertiliser, cake and mulch are all on hand.');

