  'Assess before acting. Above 85 percent, do not gap fill. Between 70 and 85 percent, gap filling up to 35 DAP is an economic decision. Below 70 percent, find the cause FIRST — if it is rot, gap filling wastes a second lot of the most expensive input.',
  'आधी कारण शोधा, मग निर्णय. उगवण ८५% वर असल्यास नांगी भरणी नको. ७० ते ८५% असल्यास ३५ दिवसांपर्यंत भरता येईल — तो आर्थिक निर्णय. ७०% पेक्षा कमी असल्यास कारण शोधा — कूज असेल तर नांगी भरणे म्हणजे सर्वात महागडी निविष्ठा दुसऱ्यांदा वाया घालवणे.',
  'No source gives a gap filling recommendation for ginger. Reasoning from the crop: emergence completes by 30 to 45 days, so plants set later never catch up, and establishment is a hard ceiling with no ratoon. If the cause is soft rot the replacement seed enters the same infested soil.',
