  'Shade decision being made AND target_product is dry_ginger',
  'सावलीचा निर्णय आणि सुंठ हा मुख्य मार्ग आहे',
  'target_product == ''dry_ginger'' AND shade_pct IS NULL', 'dsl-1.0', 'EVENT', FALSE, NULL,
  'Note that excessive direct sunlight reduces ginger aroma. Where dry ginger is the route, shade carries a quality argument as well as a heat argument. Consider a tall intercrop such as tur, or temporary netting during the hot months.',
  'जास्त सूर्यप्रकाशाने आल्याचा सुवास कमी होतो. सुंठ हा मार्ग असल्यास सावलीचा युक्तिवाद दुहेरी होतो — उष्णतेपासून बचाव आणि प्रत टिकवणे. तूरसारखे उंच आंतरपीक किंवा उन्हाळ्यात तात्पुरती जाळी विचारात घ्या.',
  'Source states that trials found aroma declines with excessive direct sunlight, and separately that the crop grows well in 25 percent shade. Kannad is an open-field high-radiation belt with no multi-storey plantation, so the aroma risk is greater here than in the shaded gardens of Kerala. Aroma is the main quality determinant for dry ginger and oil.',
  'Affects quality and therefore price rather than weight. Given the grading spread observed in the market, that can exceed a yield effect.',
  0.65, 'C', 'SRC-D', NULL, 'partial',
  'The shade net subsidy under the state scheme is for a full structure, which is probably disproportionate for a crop needing shade in only the first two months. Cheaper options — mulch, a tall intercrop, temporary netting — should be tested first.');

