  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Deep plough to about one foot, lengthwise and crosswise, then kulav until the tilth is friable and clod free. Expect three to four passes on black soil rather than the one or two the source states.',
  'एक फुटापर्यंत उभी व आडवी खोल नांगरट करा, नंतर जमीन भुसभुशीत होईपर्यंत कुळवाच्या पाळ्या द्या. काळ्या जमिनीत ढेकळे मोठी होतात, त्यामुळे स्रोतातील एक-दोन पाळ्यांऐवजी तीन-चार लागू शकतात.',
  'The crop stays in the soil for eight months and needs friable soil. The rhizome grows horizontally, so it needs loose lateral soil to expand into — compacted soil gives small misshapen rhizomes regardless of nutrition. Black soil forms larger clods so more passes are needed.',
  'Acts through rhizome size rather than plant count, so it does not appear in establishment figures.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'Land preparation is a direct decision about final rhizome size rather than merely getting ready. That framing matters because tillage is the operation most often shortened when time is tight.');

