  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Ask one question — was the operation done, and if not what got in the way? Offer options: labour, time, cost, did not seem necessary, other.',
  'एकच प्रश्न विचारा — काम झाले का, आणि नसेल तर काय अडचण आली? पर्याय द्या: मजूर नाही, वेळ नाही, खर्च, गरज वाटली नाही, इतर.',
  'If the engine recommended something and it was not done, either the message failed or the recommendation was wrong for local conditions. Both are learnable, and both are only discoverable by asking.',
  'None this season. It is the input that reveals implementation barriers, which no sensor can see.',
  0.75, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The most valuable data the product collects, because it explains why correct advice did not become a yield effect. Sensors measure the field; only this measures the gap between advice and action.');

