  'Harvest preparation begins, about 30 days before expected harvest',
  'काढणीची तयारी सुरू, अपेक्षित काढणीच्या सुमारे तीस दिवस आधी',
  'days_to_harvest BETWEEN 25 AND 35', 'dsl-1.0', 'WINDOW', FALSE, NULL,
  'State the grading spread plainly. A 2.7 times price difference was recorded within one market on one day, purely on quality. Washing and grading before sale is worth more than any yield improvement available this season.',
  'प्रतवारीचा फरक स्पष्ट सांगा. एकाच बाजारात, एकाच दिवशी, केवळ प्रतीमुळे २.७ पट भाव फरक नोंदवला गेला आहे. धुऊन आणि प्रतवारी करून विकल्यास हा फरक मिळतो — आणि तो या हंगामातील कोणत्याही उत्पादन-वाढीपेक्षा मोठा आहे.',
  'Akola market recorded Rs 6,000 to Rs 16,000 per quintal on a 180 quintal arrival on a single day. Two of the seven grading determinants — skin condition and cleanliness with uniformity — sit entirely in this domain, and both are labour-only.',
  'Not a yield factor. On 90 quintal at the two ends of that band the difference is roughly Rs 9 lakh, which exceeds every yield factor in the knowledge base combined.',
  0.82, 'B', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'full',
  'This reframes the whole knowledge base. Domains 1 to 8 work on yield; this single observation says grade matters more, and grade is set by two labour-only operations in the last fortnight.');

