  'Sort into grades and sell each grade separately. Sold together, the lower grade drags the whole consignment down to an average price.',
  'प्रतवारी करून प्रत्येक श्रेणी वेगळी विका. सर्व एकत्र विकल्यास खालच्या प्रतीचा माल वरच्या प्रतीचा भावही खाली खेचतो आणि सरासरी भाव मिळतो.',
  'The observed spread exists because buyers price on quality. A mixed lot is priced on its weakest visible fraction rather than on its average, so separation captures value that already exists in the crop.',
