  'Present the seven determinants and flag which are still changeable. Size, rot and fibre are already fixed by this point; skin condition, cleanliness, uniformity and freshness are still in the farmer''s hands.',
  'सात निकष सांगा आणि कोणते अजून बदलता येतात ते स्पष्ट करा. आकार, कूज आणि तंतू आता ठरलेले आहेत; सालीची स्थिती, स्वच्छता, एकसारखेपणा आणि ताजेपणा अजून शेतकऱ्याच्या हातात आहेत.',
  'No published grading standard for ginger was located, so the list is reasoned from the price observation and from handling practice. Separating the fixed determinants from the changeable ones directs effort where it can still act.',
