  'BLOCK the maturity conclusion. Yellowing before 200 DAP has at least six other causes in this belt. Run the diagnosis sequence before any harvest planning.',
  'पाने पिवळी पडली म्हणजे पक्वता नव्हे. या भागात दोनशे दिवसांच्या आत पिवळेपणाची किमान सहा वेगळी कारणे आहेत. काढणीचे नियोजन करण्यापूर्वी निदान करा.',
  'Yellowing in this belt can be nitrogen deficiency, iron or zinc lock-up from free lime, waterlogging, soft rot, bacterial wilt or heat scorch. Reading it as maturity would mean harvesting early and, worse, missing a rot diagnosis.',
  'Prevents both premature harvest and a missed disease diagnosis worth up to 0.70.',
  0.88, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'partial',
  'Calcareous yellowing is expected here rather than exceptional, so this block will fire often. That is correct — the alternative is a farmer harvesting a month early because the leaves looked ready.');

