  'Dry ginger has been produced',
  'सुंठ तयार झाली',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Record the actual dry recovery percentage. Planning uses 19 percent; published ranges run from 15 to 25 and vary by variety.',
  'प्रत्यक्ष सुंठ उतारा नोंदवा. नियोजनात १९% वापरला आहे; प्रकाशित श्रेणी १५ ते २५% आहे आणि ती जातीनुसार बदलते.',
  'Recovery varies by variety from 18.7 to 23 percent among the four main options, and drying method affects it too. The actual figure for this variety under this method on this plot is not knowable from publications.',
  'Determines whether the processing route is economic.',
  0.75, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'full',
  'If dry ginger becomes the main route, Rejatha at 23 percent recovery becomes a serious candidate despite ranking third on fresh yield. The recovery figure is what settles that choice.');

