  'Skin removal in progress for drying',
  'सुंठेसाठी साल काढली जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Scrape the skin, do not peel it deeply, and use a sharpened bamboo edge rather than a metal knife. The oil and aroma compounds sit immediately below the skin.',
  'साल फक्त खरडून काढा, खोल काढू नका, आणि धातूच्या सुरीऐवजी बांबूची टोकदार कड वापरा. तेल आणि सुगंधी घटक सालीच्या अगदी खाली असतात — खोल साल काढल्यास वजन आणि प्रत दोन्ही जाते.',
  'The source specifies bamboo rather than metal. Bamboo is softer and does not cut deep, which preserves the sub-surface oil layer that carries the aroma. Aroma is the main quality determinant for dry ginger and oil.',
  'Protects both recovery weight and quality grade.',
  0.75, 'C', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'A tool-choice instruction that looks trivial and is not. Metal knives are faster and more available, and the loss they cause is invisible until the product is graded.');

