ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

  'Ginger is spread out for sun drying and evening approaches',
  'सुंठ वाळत घातली आहे आणि संध्याकाळ होत आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Cover with tarpaulin in the evening WITHOUT gathering the produce into a heap. Cooking smoke darkens the produce and darkened ginger drops a grade.',
  'सायंकाळी पसरलेले आले गोळा न करता ताडपत्रीने झाकून घ्या. गावात संध्याकाळी चुली पेटतात आणि धुराने माल काळपट पडतो — आणि काळपट पडलेली सुंठ खालच्या प्रतीत जाते.',
  'The source gives this instruction explicitly with the reason. Rural evenings mean cooking smoke, and it discolours drying produce. Gathering the produce would also trap moisture and slow drying.',
  'Pure grade protection at zero cost.',
  0.78, 'C', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'Free, specific, and the kind of detail that only appears in a practitioner source. It is also exactly the sort of instruction a daily reminder handles well.');

