  'The soda khar caustic method is requested or about to be described as a farm operation',
  'सोडा खार पद्धत विचारली जात आहे किंवा शेतातील नेहमीचे काम म्हणून सांगितली जात आहे',
  'drying_method == ''soda_khar''', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', TRUE, 'The safety warning must precede the method, always.',
  'Present the safety warning FIRST, before any procedure. Boiling 50 percent caustic soda causes immediate severe burns and permanent blindness on eye contact. Do not present this as a routine farm operation. Recommend a group or cooperative processing facility. If the method is described at all, list the required protective equipment and state that it must not be attempted without a trained operator.',
  'आधी सुरक्षा इशारा द्या, मग पद्धत. उकळते ५०% कॉस्टिक सोडा द्रावण त्वचेवर पडल्यास तात्काळ गंभीर भाजते आणि डोळ्यात गेल्यास कायमचे अंधत्व येते. हे शेतकऱ्याच्या अंगणातील नेहमीचे काम नाही. गट किंवा सहकारी प्रक्रिया केंद्राचा पर्याय सुचवा. पद्धत सांगायचीच असल्यास संरक्षक साधने आणि प्रशिक्षित व्यक्तीशिवाय करू नये हे स्पष्ट सांगा.',
  'The method requires three boiling caustic soda solutions at 20, 25 and 50 percent, with dipping times measured in seconds. The margin for error is small and the consequence of error is permanent. The stated advantage — better foreign market demand because Malabar-method ginger retains higher calcium — is real, but it does not change the hazard.',
  'None. This is a safety rule.',
  0.92, 'C', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Export-grade dry ginger is an attractive route and it is not safe at individual farm level. The honest answer is that this belongs to a shared facility, and the MoFPI food processing scheme noted in Domain 10 may be the institutional route to one.');

