  'A processing method is being chosen',
  'प्रक्रिया पद्धत निवडली जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Rank simple sun drying first in every case. It uses no chemicals, is completely safe, suits this climate, needs almost no capital, and can be started today. Only move to a chemical method if a verified price premium justifies it and the safety and residue questions are settled.',
  'प्रत्येक वेळी साधी वाळवणी पद्धत प्रथम. तिला रसायन लागत नाही, ती पूर्णपणे सुरक्षित आहे, इथल्या हवामानाला अनुकूल आहे, भांडवल जवळपास शून्य आहे, आणि ती आजपासून करता येते. भाव-फरक निश्चित झाल्याशिवाय आणि सुरक्षा व अवशेषांचे प्रश्न सुटल्याशिवाय रासायनिक पद्धतीकडे जाऊ नये.',
  'Of the three methods, one uses no chemicals and two carry either a residue question or a serious hazard. The price differential that would justify the chemical methods has not been measured, so there is no basis for accepting the risk.',
  'Directs the route decision by evidence and safety rather than by product appearance.',
  0.8, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The white colour that the chemical methods produce is a marketing attribute rather than a quality one. Until the premium is measured, accepting a burns hazard or a residue question to obtain it is not a rational trade.');

