  'Further value addition is being considered beyond dry ginger',
  'सुंठेच्या पुढे मूल्यवर्धनाचा विचार',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Powder is the next step — grind well-dried ginger, sieve through 50 to 60 mesh, pack airtight. Note that every step up the ladder raises value per kilo and reduces total weight, so the price multiple has to be checked at each step.',
  'पुढील टप्पा पावडर — चांगली वाळलेली सुंठ दळून ५० ते ६० मेशच्या चाळणीतून चाळा आणि हवाबंद पिशवीत भरा. प्रत्येक टप्प्यावर प्रति किलो मूल्य वाढते पण एकूण वजन घटते, म्हणून प्रत्येक पायरीवर भावाचा पट तपासावा लागतो.',
  'Powder is used for oleoresin extraction and spice products. The value chain runs fresh, dry, powder, oleoresin, with value rising and weight falling at each stage.',
  'Depends entirely on prices that are not yet known.',
  0.65, 'C', 'SRC-D', NULL, 'full',
  'Ranked low because the prices for dry ginger and powder are both unknown. Processing more is not automatically earning more, and without the price data the ladder cannot be evaluated.');

