  'Dry ginger is being stored AND storage_loss_monthly_pct is unknown',
  'सुंठ साठवली जात आहे पण मासिक घट माहीत नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Weigh a sample each month and record the loss. Without this figure the hold-or-sell decision cannot be computed at all — net return equals expected price times one minus cumulative loss, minus storage cost.',
  'दर महिन्याला नमुना वजन करून घट नोंदवा. हा आकडा नसेल तर विकावे की थांबावे हा निर्णय मोजताच येत नाही — निव्वळ परतावा म्हणजे अपेक्षित भाव गुणिले (एक वजा संचित घट) उणे साठवण खर्च.',
  'The storage decision model requires the loss rate as an input and no source supplies it for dry ginger. Two weighings a month apart begin to answer it, and a season of them answers it properly.',
  'None directly. Unblocks the most valuable economic decision in the domain.',
  0.8, 'B', 'FIELD', NULL, 'full',
  'This is the single measurement that converts the storage strategy from guesswork into arithmetic, and it costs a set of scales and one weighing a month.');

