  'Dry ginger stored AND moisture_pct_final above 10',
  'सुंठ साठवली आहे पण पाण्याचा अंश दहा टक्क्यांहून जास्त',
  'drying_method IS NOT NULL AND moisture_pct_final > 10', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', FALSE, NULL,
  'Do not store until moisture is down to 8 to 10 percent. Above that, mould develops and the whole lot is at risk.',
  'पाण्याचा अंश ८ ते १०% येईपर्यंत साठवू नका. त्यापेक्षा जास्त असल्यास बुरशी लागते आणि संपूर्ण लॉट धोक्यात येतो.',
  'Both drying methods specify 8 to 10 percent final moisture. Above that the product supports mould growth during storage, and a stored lot fails as a whole rather than partially.',
  'Protects the entire processed output.',
  0.82, 'C', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'partial',
  'The hand-rubbing finish described in the source is the traditional test for this endpoint. A moisture meter would be more reliable and is inexpensive.');

