  'Market access is being assessed before planting',
  'लागवडीपूर्वी बाजाराची उपलब्धता तपासली जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'State that this is a thin market. State-wide daily arrivals run 1,297 to 3,695 quintal against 330,007 for onion — roughly one percent. The local APMC does not appear in the arrival lists at all, so enquire directly with local traders before planting a large area.',
  'हा पातळ बाजार आहे. राज्यभर दैनिक आवक १,२९७ ते ३,६९५ क्विंटल, तर कांद्याची ३,३०,००७ — म्हणजे सुमारे एक टक्का. स्थानिक बाजार समिती आवकेच्या यादीत कुठेही नाही, म्हणून मोठे क्षेत्र लावण्यापूर्वी स्थानिक व्यापाऱ्यांकडे थेट चौकशी करा.',
  'A thin market means a modest increase in arrivals moves the price a long way, and it means the local outlet may not exist at all. Both matter more for a high-value crop with a large sunk cost than for a staple.',
  'Informs the area decision before the money is spent.',
  0.78, 'B', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'full',
  'Market thinness is also why storage capacity matters here. In a thin market the ability to wait is the only real bargaining power a grower has.');

