  'The sell-or-hold decision is being made',
  'विकावे की थांबावे हा निर्णय घ्यायचा आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Present the four options with their trade-offs and the arithmetic behind each. Do NOT recommend one. State plainly that the engine does not forecast prices — it shows today''s actual rates, the storage loss and cost arithmetic, and what the net return would be at a given price.',
  'चार पर्याय आणि त्यांच्या तडजोडी गणितासह मांडा, पण एकाची शिफारस करू नका. स्पष्ट सांगा — engine भाव वर्तवत नाही. ते आजचे प्रत्यक्ष भाव, साठवण घट व खर्चाचे गणित, आणि दिलेल्या भावाला निव्वळ परतावा किती होईल एवढेच दाखवते.',
  'In a thin market with high volatility a single recommendation would be a price forecast in disguise, and the engine has no basis for one. Presenting the arithmetic lets the farmer apply their own view of the price and their own cash position.',
  'None. It is the difference between decision support and a bet placed on the farmer''s behalf.',
  0.85, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Four of the five inputs the decision model needs are still missing — dry ginger price, processing cost, monthly storage loss and a multi-year price series. The engine should present the framework and ask the farmer to supply the local numbers, which they can get from a trader more accurately than we can estimate.');

