  'Processing is being considered as a route',
  'प्रक्रिया हा मार्ग विचारात घेतला जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Show the break-even arithmetic. 100 kg fresh yields 20 to 25 kg dry, so the dry price must be four to five times the fresh price merely to break even, before labour, fuel, space and time. Processing more is not automatically earning more.',
  'समतोल गणित दाखवा. १०० किलो ओल्या आल्यापासून २० ते २५ किलो सुंठ मिळते, म्हणजे सुंठेचा भाव ओल्या आल्याच्या चार ते पाच पट असल्याशिवाय बरोबरीही होत नाही — आणि त्यात श्रम, इंधन, जागा व वेळ धरलेला नाही. जास्त प्रक्रिया म्हणजे आपोआप जास्त पैसा नव्हे.',
  'Recovery of 20 to 25 percent sets the break-even multiple arithmetically. The assumption that processing always adds income is common and wrong, and the arithmetic settles it in one line.',
  'Prevents an unprofitable processing decision.',
  0.8, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The dry ginger price is the missing number that makes this computable. A single enquiry with a local trader would supply it, and it is worth making before harvest rather than after.');

