  'A chemical processing method is being described AND ppe_available is false or processing_trained_operator is false',
  'रासायनिक प्रक्रिया पद्धत सांगितली जात आहे पण संरक्षक साधने नाहीत किंवा प्रशिक्षित व्यक्ती नाही',
  'drying_method IN [soda_khar, malabar_lime_sulphur] AND (ppe_available IS FALSE OR processing_trained_operator IS FALSE)', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', TRUE, 'Boiling caustic soda causes permanent injury. PPE and training are not negotiable.',
  'BLOCK the procedure. Require rubber gloves, face shield or goggles, apron and closed footwear, and a trained operator, before any chemical method is described as actionable. Otherwise present only the safe simple drying route.',
  'पद्धत अडवा. रबरी हातमोजे, चष्मा किंवा फेस शील्ड, ॲप्रन आणि बंद बूट, आणि प्रशिक्षित व्यक्ती — यांशिवाय कोणतीही रासायनिक पद्धत करण्याजोगी म्हणून सांगू नये. त्याऐवजी फक्त सुरक्षित साधी वाळवणी पद्धत दाखवा.',
  'Boiling caustic soda and closed-room sulphur fumigation both carry consequences that are permanent rather than merely costly. Describing the procedure without the equipment in place makes the harm more likely rather than less.',
  'None. Operator safety.',
  0.92, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The engine can describe a method and still refuse to present it as actionable. That distinction matters here, because the information is legitimate and the unsupervised execution is not.');

