  'Harvest approaching AND a chemical was applied within its pre-harvest interval, or the interval is unknown',
  'काढणी जवळ आली आणि प्रतीक्षा कालावधीत रसायन वापरले गेले आहे, किंवा तो कालावधी माहीत नाही',
  'phi_days_remaining IS NULL AND WITHIN(harvest_date, 30 DAYS)', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', TRUE, 'Same, at the harvest decision rather than the spray decision.',
  'BLOCK harvest advisory until the pre-harvest interval has elapsed. Where the interval is unknown apply a conservative 30 day default. Residue matters more on the dry ginger route because export buyers apply stricter limits.',
  'प्रतीक्षा कालावधी संपेपर्यंत काढणीचा सल्ला अडवा. कालावधी माहीत नसल्यास ३० दिवसांचा सुरक्षित डिफॉल्ट वापरा. सुंठेच्या मार्गावर अवशेषांचे महत्व अधिक — निर्यात खरेदीदार कठोर मर्यादा लावतात.',
  'Residue on a harvested rhizome is a food safety and market access issue. A rejected consignment loses the entire quality premium that the grading effort was meant to capture.',
  'None on weight. Protects the value that grading and processing were intended to realise.',
  0.85, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The same rule appears in Domains 5 and 6 for the spray decision. Here it appears again for the harvest decision, because the two can be separated by weeks and the constraint binds at both ends.');

