  'Harvest complete AND produce_washed is false',
  'काढणी झाली पण माल धुतलेला नाही',
  'harvest_date IS NOT NULL AND produce_washed IS FALSE', 'dsl-1.0', 'ONCE_UNTIL_RESOLVED', FALSE, NULL,
  'Wash the rhizomes clean and free of soil before sale. Soil-covered produce looks like a lower grade and the trader deducts the soil from the weight, so the loss falls twice.',
  'विक्रीपूर्वी गड्डे स्वच्छ धुवून मातीपासून वेगळे करा. मातीने माखलेला माल खालच्या प्रतीचा दिसतो आणि व्यापारी वजनातून मातीही वजा करतो — नुकसान दोनदा होते.',
  'The source instructs washing before dispatch. Cleanliness is one of the three grading determinants that remain in the farmer''s hands at this point, and unwashed produce is penalised on both appearance and weight.',
  'Directly affects realised price through the 2.7 times grading spread.',
  0.8, 'C', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'full',
  'Washing is labour, and it is repaid in the price rather than in the weight. That makes it easy to skip when labour is short at harvest and expensive to have skipped when the lot is graded.');

