  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Separate the seed fraction now, break off the thick roots, and treat before storage. The pre-storage treatment is the step most often skipped because the next crop feels distant in December.',
  'बेण्याचा भाग आत्ताच वेगळा काढा, जाड मुळ्या तोडा, आणि साठवणीपूर्वी प्रक्रिया करा. डिसेंबरमध्ये पुढचे पीक दूर वाटते, म्हणून साठवणीपूर्वीची प्रक्रिया हीच सर्वात जास्त वेळा वगळली जाते.',
  'Seed rhizome is treated twice, once before storage and once before planting. Treating only at planting does not address infection established inside the rhizome during four to five months of storage.',
  'Affects next season''s establishment ceiling and seed cost.',
  0.8, 'A', 'SRC-D', NULL, 'none',
  'Blocked entirely if the plot has a recorded rot or wilt history. In that case the seed comes from elsewhere regardless of the cost comparison.');

