  'Harvest complete',
  'काढणी पूर्ण झाली',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Record the actual cost incurred line by line — seed, land preparation, mulch, fertiliser, plant protection, labour, harvest and transport. The Domain 13 model currently runs on estimates for several of these.',
  'प्रत्यक्ष खर्च बाबनिहाय नोंदवा — बेणे, पूर्वमशागत, आच्छादन, खते, कीड-रोग नियंत्रण, मजुरी, काढणी आणि वाहतूक. सध्याचे आर्थिक गणित यांपैकी अनेक बाबींवर अंदाजाने चालते.',
  'The Kannad cost estimate of about Rs 1,45,000 per acre adds mulch, drainage and micronutrient lines that the standard published sheet omits, and several figures are estimates. Only recorded actuals can correct them.',
  'None. Corrects the economics model.',
  0.8, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Transport cost in particular is unmeasured and it decides whether the market-splitting strategy is worth executing. It is a single number that unlocks a whole rule.');

