  'Subsidised work about to begin AND pre_sanction_received is false',
  'अनुदानाचे काम सुरू होणार आहे पण पूर्वसंमती मिळालेली नाही',
  'pre_sanction_received IS FALSE AND subsidy_scheme_applied IS NOT NULL', 'dsl-1.0', 'ONCE_UNTIL_RESOLVED', FALSE, NULL,
  'BLOCK. Work started before pre-sanction is not eligible for subsidy. Wait for the pre-sanction letter before laying drip or excavating a pond.',
  'थांबा. पूर्वसंमतीपूर्वी सुरू केलेल्या कामाला अनुदान मिळत नाही. ठिबक अंथरण्यापूर्वी किंवा शेततळे खोदण्यापूर्वी पूर्वसंमतीचे पत्र येऊ द्या.',
  'The scheme process is application, scrutiny, lottery, pre-sanction, then work. Starting early because the planting calendar is tight is the most common and most expensive error, because it forfeits the entire subsidy on work that was going to be done anyway.',
  'None on yield. It can cost the whole subsidy on the largest capital item.',
  0.85, 'B', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'none',
  'This collides directly with the tight land preparation calendar. The resolution is to start the application six months early rather than to start the work early, and the engine has to say so before March.');

