  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'State clearly that selection is by lottery and never promise the subsidy. Present both the with-subsidy and without-subsidy cost cases. If not selected, the fallback is to reduce area rather than to skip drip.',
  'निवड लॉटरी पद्धतीने होते हे स्पष्ट सांगा — अनुदान मिळेल असे आश्वासन कधीही देऊ नका. अनुदानासह आणि अनुदानाशिवाय अशी दोन्ही गणिते दाखवा. निवड झाली नाही तर ठिबक वगळण्याऐवजी क्षेत्र कमी करावे.',
  'Beneficiary selection is explicitly by lottery. A farmer who plans on receiving it and does not is left either without drip, which makes the crop unviable here, or with an unplanned capital cost.',
  'None directly. Prevents a plan built on an uncertain input.',
  0.85, 'B', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'full',
  'Reducing area rather than dropping drip is the right fallback, because drip is a precondition here while area is a choice. The same logic as the poor-year water planning rule.');

