  'ऑक्टोबर ते फेब्रुवारीसाठी पाणी जेमतेम आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Recommend a lined farm pond, subsidised at 50 percent up to Rs 75,000. It stores the monsoon water that the drainage channels are already carrying away and supplies it back after October.',
  'अस्तरीकरण केलेले शेततळे विचारात घ्या — ५०% किंवा ₹७५,००० पर्यंत अनुदान. मान्सूनमध्ये जे पाणी निचरा चरातून वाहून जाते तेच साठवून ऑक्टोबरनंतर वापरता येते.',
  'Two problems solve each other. Monsoon water must leave the root zone to prevent soft rot, and about 27 lakh litres per acre are needed from October to February when rainfall has ended. Storage converts the disposal problem into the supply.',
