  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Caution against it as a first step. The scheme funds a full shadenet house, whereas ginger needs about 25 percent shade for roughly the first two months. Test mulch, a tall intercrop such as tur, or temporary netting first.',
  'हा पहिला पर्याय म्हणून घेऊ नका. योजना पूर्ण शेडनेट हाऊससाठी आहे, तर अद्रकाला साधारण पहिले दोन महिने सुमारे २५% सावली लागते. आधी आच्छादन, तूरसारखे उंच आंतरपीक, किंवा तात्पुरती जाळी तपासा.',
  'The crop''s shade requirement is seasonal and partial, while the scheme funds a permanent full structure. Spending the capital on a disproportionate solution crowds out cheaper measures that address the same May heat problem.',
  'Prevents misallocated capital rather than adding yield.',
  0.7, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Worth revisiting if the dry ginger route is chosen, because excess sunlight reduces aroma and aroma is the main quality determinant for dry ginger. The quality argument could justify what the heat argument alone does not.');

