  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Request free lime, zinc and iron SEPARATELY. They are absent from the standard soil health card and they are precisely the parameters that drive the calcareous yellowing problem and the whole micronutrient schedule.',
  'मुक्त चुनखडी, जस्त आणि लोह हे तीन घटक वेगळे मागा. नेहमीच्या मृदा आरोग्य पत्रिकेत ते नसतात — आणि तेच चुनखडीमुळे होणारा पिवळेपणा आणि संपूर्ण सूक्ष्म अन्नद्रव्य वेळापत्रक ठरवतात.',
  'The routine panel covers pH, EC, organic carbon and NPK. Free lime predicts whether the yellowing problem will occur; zinc and iron are the nutrients it locks up. Without them the Domain 4 micronutrient rules run on assumption.',
  'Enables correct micronutrient dosing, worth u = 0.11.',
  0.85, 'A', 'SRC-Q', NULL, 'full',
  'Requesting them separately is the whole point. A farmer who simply asks for a soil test will receive a report without the three parameters that matter most here.');

