  'Use the sub-additive formula: total loss equals one minus the product of one minus each u-value. Never add the u-values.',
  'sub-additive सूत्र वापरा — एकूण घट = १ वजा (प्रत्येक घटकाच्या १ वजा u यांचा गुणाकार). u मूल्यांची बेरीज कधीही करू नका.',
  'Losses act on what remains, not on the original crop. Five factors of 0.20 each sum to 1.00, which would mean zero yield and is impossible; multiplied they give 0.67 loss with 33 percent remaining, which is realistic.',
  'Method rather than a factor. Wrong aggregation produces impossible predictions.',
  0.9, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The additive error is easy to make and produces confident nonsense. With six moderate factors it would predict a negative harvest, which no farmer would believe and which would discredit everything else the engine says.');

