  'Advisory priority is being computed for a set of pending actions',
  'प्रलंबित कृतींचा प्राधान्यक्रम ठरवला जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Score by u-value multiplied by two if the factor is irrecoverable, multiplied by one and a half if the action window is open now. Irrecoverability and urgency both raise priority above the raw u-value.',
  'गुण = u × (भरून निघत नसेल तर २) × (खिडकी आत्ता उघडी असेल तर १.५). भरून न निघणे आणि तातडी — दोन्ही केवळ u मूल्यापेक्षा प्राधान्य वर नेतात.',
  'A recoverable 0.15 factor and an irrecoverable 0.15 factor are not equally urgent. Nor are two identical factors when one window closes this week and the other in two months.',
  'Determines which advisory the farmer sees first when several are due.',
  0.75, 'B', 'EST', NULL, 'full',
  'The multipliers are judgement rather than measurement. What matters is that the ordering is explicit and reviewable rather than emerging accidentally from the order the rules were written in.');

