  'काही दिवसांत अनेक सूचना एकत्र येत आहेत',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Bundle them into one instruction list ordered by priority score. Do not issue separate notifications. The 75 to 90 DAP bundle alone protects u-values of 0.125, 0.175 and 0.200 in a single field visit.',
  'त्या सर्व एका सूचना यादीत, प्राधान्य गुणानुसार क्रमाने द्या — वेगवेगळ्या सूचना पाठवू नका. ७५ ते ९० दिवसांचा गुच्छ एकाच फेरीत ०.१२५, ०.१७५ आणि ०.२०० ही तीन u मूल्ये संरक्षित करतो.',
  'The farmer visits the field once. Three separate notifications on three days produce three ignored notifications, and the accumulated u-value at stake in the earthing-up window is about half the season''s controllable loss.',
  'Adherence is what converts a correct recommendation into a yield effect.',
  0.8, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
