  'Request the establishment count now. It is the first real measurement of the season, it resets the ceiling, and it cannot be reconstructed later.',
  'उगवणीची मोजणी आत्ताच करा. हंगामातील हे पहिले खरे मोजमाप आहे, ते कमाल मर्यादा पुन्हा ठरवते, आणि नंतर ते पुन्हा मोजता येत नाही.',
  'By 45 days emergence is complete and by 60 days the gaps have closed visually, so the count has a narrow window. It is also the input that converts a pre-season estimate into a grounded prediction.',
