  'पाणी साचण्याची किंवा ओलाव्याच्या ताणाची घटना घडली',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Record it in hours or days with the stage it occurred in. These events carry the largest u-values in the register and they leave no trace afterwards unless recorded at the time.',
  'ती घटना तासांत किंवा दिवसांत, कोणत्या अवस्थेत घडली यासह नोंदवा. या घटनांची u मूल्ये नोंदवहीतील सर्वात मोठी आहेत, आणि त्या वेळी नोंदवल्या नाहीत तर नंतर त्यांचा मागमूसही उरत नाही.',
  'Saturation at G2 or G3 carries 0.35, water exhaustion in G4 carries 0.30, and critical window stress carries 0.20. All three are sensor-detectable at the time and invisible afterwards, which makes them the events most likely to be lost from the attribution.',
  'None directly. Without these records the gap attribution attributes their loss to the residual.',
  0.85, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'none',
  'This is where the sub-node earns its place in the attribution. A farmer will not remember how many hours the field stood saturated in August; the sensor log will.');

