  'The system is being described to a partner, investor or farmer as learning AI',
  'प्रणालीचे वर्णन शिकणारे AI असे केले जात आहे',
  'capability_claim_proposed IS NOT NULL', 'dsl-1.0', 'SILENT_GUARD', TRUE, 'Describing the system accurately is a commercial and regulatory obligation.',
  'BLOCK the claim. Describe it accurately: a decision-support system running on agronomist-authored rules and sensor input, which becomes more accurate each season. Do not claim machine learning that does not exist yet.',
  'हा दावा टाळा. अचूक वर्णन द्या — कृषितज्ज्ञांच्या नियमांवर आणि sensor माहितीवर चालणारी निर्णय-सहाय्य प्रणाली, जी हंगामागणिक अधिक अचूक होते. अजून अस्तित्वात नसलेल्या machine learning चा दावा करू नये.',
  'For the first two or three seasons there is no field data, 22 of 35 u-values are estimates, and there are no labelled images. A technical reviewer in a POC discussion can tell a rule engine from a learned model, and the overstatement costs credibility that the accurate description would have kept.',
  'None. Protects commercial and technical credibility.',
  0.9, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Being honest here is not a weakness in the pitch. A rule engine that explains itself is easier to defend than a black box, and the POC partners named in the project notes are technical organisations.');

