  'Scale frequency by stage criticality — hourly in G1, G3 and G4, four-hourly in G2 and G5, daily in G0, and hourly at all stages during a rain alert. This is a power management decision as well as an agronomic one.',
  'अवस्थेच्या निकडीनुसार वारंवारता ठरवा — G1, G3, G4 मध्ये तासाला, G2 आणि G5 मध्ये चार तासांनी, G0 मध्ये दिवसातून एकदा, आणि पावसाच्या इशाऱ्यादरम्यान सर्व अवस्थांत तासाला. हा agronomy इतकाच वीज-व्यवस्थापनाचा निर्णयही आहे.',
  'Saturation damage accrues over hours, so hourly sampling is needed when the crop is sensitive. Battery and LoRa airtime on the sub-node are finite, so uniform high-frequency sampling is not an option.',
  'Affects how early a saturation event is detected, which carries the largest u-value in the register.',
  0.78, 'B', 'EST', NULL, 'full',
  'The ATmega328P sub-node has limited power budget, so this is a real constraint rather than a preference. Sampling everything hourly all season would not survive the season.');

