  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Run the five-question decision tree before recommending anything. Is the soil wet, did it wilt while green, is the central shoot dead, which leaves are yellow, and was it above 35 C. Six causes, different treatments, and two where the reflexive response makes it worse.',
  'काहीही सुचवण्यापूर्वी पाच प्रश्नांचा निर्णय-वृक्ष चालवा — मुळाजवळची माती ओली आहे का, पाने हिरवीच असताना कोमेजली का, सुरळी मेली आहे का, कोणती पाने पिवळी, आणि तापमान ३५ अंशांवर गेले का. सहा कारणे, वेगळे उपाय, आणि दोन ठिकाणी नेहमीची प्रतिक्रिया परिस्थिती बिघडवते.',
  'This is the one genuinely event-driven classification problem in the crop. Most advisory is calendar-driven. Urea on waterlogged soil makes it worse, and any fungicide on bacterial wilt is wasted while the pathogen spreads.',
  'Prevents wasted input and, more importantly, prevents a missed rot or wilt diagnosis worth up to 0.70.',
  0.88, 'A', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'partial',
  'Calcareous yellowing is expected here rather than exceptional, so this tree will run often. That is correct — the alternative is urea applied to an iron lock-up every time.');

