  'System performance is being measured or reported',
  'प्रणालीची कामगिरी मोजली किंवा नोंदवली जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Use action compliance rate as the primary metric — recommended actions completed on time divided by recommended actions issued. Target above 60 percent in season one and above 80 percent by season three. Do not report messages sent or app opens.',
  'मुख्य मापदंड म्हणून कृती-पालन दर वापरा — वेळेवर पूर्ण झालेल्या कृती भागिले सुचवलेल्या कृती. पहिल्या हंगामात ६०% वर, तिसऱ्या हंगामापर्यंत ८०% वर हे लक्ष्य. पाठवलेले संदेश किंवा ॲप उघडण्याची संख्या नोंदवू नका.',
  'Four decisions worth about Rs 2.85 lakh per acre all depend on doing something at the right time. So system success is whether the farmer acted on time, and that requires a record rather than a model to measure.',
  'None directly. It is the metric that connects advisory to yield.',
  0.85, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Messages sent measures effort, app opens measures curiosity, and neither measures whether the crop was better. Compliance rate measures the only thing that converts advice into yield.');

