ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

  'A trigger fired and the predicted event did not follow',
  'इशारा दिला पण अपेक्षित घटना घडली नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Record it as a false alarm but do not reflexively raise the threshold. For irrecoverable factors a high false alarm rate is the correct trade — ten unnecessary drainage inspections cost ten walks; one missed saturation event costs most of the crop.',
  'ती खोटी सूचना म्हणून नोंदवा, पण लगेच मर्यादा वाढवू नका. भरून न निघणाऱ्या घटकांसाठी जास्त खोट्या सूचना हा योग्य सौदा आहे — दहा अनावश्यक निचरा तपासण्या म्हणजे दहा फेऱ्या; एक चुकलेली संपृक्तता घटना म्हणजे बहुतांश पीक.',
  'For a factor that cannot be recovered, detection after the event has no remedial value, so the trigger must fire on the precondition. The asymmetry between the cost of a false alarm and the cost of a miss justifies a high sensitivity setting.',
  'Protects the largest u-values in the register from being tuned away.',
  0.8, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The counter-pressure is notification fatigue. The answer is to keep the advisory quiet in calm periods so that a red alert still carries weight, rather than to raise the threshold on the alerts that matter.');

