  'The effect of the advisory needs demonstrating',
  'advisory चा परिणाम सिद्ध करायचा आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Compare a new cluster against its own previous season rather than withholding advice from a control group. Withholding is ethically uncomfortable and practically difficult.',
  'नियंत्रण गट ठेवून काही शेतांना सल्ला नाकारण्याऐवजी, नवीन cluster ची तुलना त्याच्याच मागील हंगामाशी करा. सल्ला नाकारणे नैतिकदृष्ट्या नाजूक आणि व्यावहारिकदृष्ट्या अवघड आहे.',
  'A true control group would give the cleanest evidence but requires denying advice to farmers who could benefit. A before-and-after comparison within the same cluster is weaker evidence but avoids that problem and is achievable.',
  'None. Determines whether the product''s effect can be demonstrated to partners.',
  0.7, 'B', 'EST', NULL, 'full',
  'The before-and-after comparison is confounded by weather, which varies more here than in most belts. Reporting it alongside the season''s rainfall against the long-term average is the honest way to present it.');

