  'Season 1 planning',
  'पहिल्या हंगामाचे नियोजन',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Season 1 delivers the rule engine, templated Marathi messages, the ten minimum records, sensor calibration, photograph collection without labelling, compliance measurement and the DPDP consent structure. No machine learning.',
  'पहिला हंगाम — नियम-इंजिन कार्यरत, साचेबद्ध मराठी संदेश, दहा किमान नोंदी, sensor calibration, फोटो जमवणे (लेबल न लावता), कृती-पालन दर मोजणे, आणि DPDP संमती रचना. Machine learning नाही.',
  'Each season one item is either immediately valuable or is data that cannot be collected retrospectively. Nothing in the list depends on a model existing.',
  'Delivers the full layer 1 and layer 2 value in the first season.',
  0.82, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Photograph collection is on the season one list despite no model existing, because photographs of a rot outbreak cannot be taken after the season ends.');

