  'Season 4 or later AND the accumulated records support model training',
  'चौथा हंगाम किंवा नंतर, आणि जमा झालेल्या नोंदी मॉडेल प्रशिक्षणासाठी पुरेशा आहेत',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'At this point local u-values can feed back into the rule engine, a fine-tuned Marathi dialogue model becomes viable, and multi-cluster federated learning becomes possible. This is when the word AI can be used honestly.',
  'आता स्थानिक u मूल्ये नियम-इंजिनमध्ये परत जोडता येतील, मराठी संवाद मॉडेल fine-tune करता येईल, आणि अनेक cluster मध्ये federated learning शक्य होईल. याच टप्प्यावर ''AI'' हा शब्द प्रामाणिकपणे वापरता येईल.',
  'Three or four seasons of gap attribution move a substantial share of the 22 estimated u-values into FIELD class, and by then the controlled vocabulary and labelled images exist. The learning layer improves accuracy; it does not enable anything that was impossible before.',
  'Improves accuracy of predictions and triggers rather than adding new capability.',
  0.7, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Stating when the claim becomes true is more useful than claiming it now. It also gives the team a concrete definition of done for the learning layer rather than an open-ended aspiration.');

