  'A light trap is installed AND nightly counts are not being recorded',
  'प्रकाश सापळा लावला आहे पण रोजची संख्या नोंदवली जात नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Record the nightly catch by hand from season one. The count is a direct measure of pest pressure and is currently discarded. Aggregated across a cluster it would produce a local pest pressure map, and it cannot be collected retrospectively.',
  'पहिल्या हंगामापासून रोजची संख्या हाताने नोंदवा. ती संख्या कीड-दाबाचे थेट माप आहे आणि सध्या ती फेकून दिली जाते. cluster मध्ये एकत्र केल्यास स्थानिक कीड-दाब नकाशा तयार होईल — आणि ही माहिती मागे जाऊन जमवता येत नाही.',
  'The light trap is already a recommended practice for shoot borer, so the farmer will accept it. Adding a counter to the sub-node later would automate it, but the manual record is what makes the first two seasons of data exist at all.',
  'None directly. Builds a local dataset that exists nowhere else.',
  0.75, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'none',
  'A device already in the field, already accepted by the farmer, producing a measurement that is currently thrown away. That is the cheapest data asset available in the whole system.');

