  'A cost estimate is being prepared for a Kannad plot',
  'Kannad मधील शेतासाठी खर्चाचा अंदाज तयार केला जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Use about Rs 1,45,000 per acre, not the published Rs 1,15,000. The standard sheet omits mulch, drainage channels and micronutrient sprays, which together are about Rs 22,500 and are all required here.',
  'एकरी सुमारे १,४५,००० रुपये धरा, प्रकाशित १,१५,००० नव्हे. प्रमाणित ताळेबंदात आच्छादन, निचरा चर आणि सूक्ष्म अन्नद्रव्य फवारणी या तीन बाबी नाहीत — त्या मिळून सुमारे २२,५०० रुपये आहेत आणि इथे तिन्ही आवश्यक आहेत.',
  'Mulch is required by Domains 3, 6 and 7 and carries the best-quantified preventive value in the knowledge base. Drainage channels are a precondition on vertisol. Micronutrient sprays are needed because free lime locks up zinc and iron. None appears in the published sheet.',
  'None directly. An understated budget leads to items being dropped mid-season, and the dropped items are usually the ones that were not budgeted.',
  0.75, 'C', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The omissions are not accidental. The published sheet describes a belt where mulch is optional and drainage is natural. Here neither is true, and the difference is about 20 percent of the budget.');

ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

