ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

  'Budget is being finalised AND cost_mulch is zero or absent',
  'अंदाजपत्रक अंतिम केले जात आहे आणि आच्छादनाची तरतूद नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Add a mulch line to the budget. Compute it from area, local material price and the three-stage quantity rather than using a fixed figure — about Rs 15,000 per acre is a working default for this belt where sugarcane trash and wheat straw are available. It is roughly 10.5 percent of total cost and it carries the best-quantified return in the knowledge base: soft rot below 5 percent against a district average of 20 to 30 percent.',
  'अंदाजपत्रकात आच्छादनाची तरतूद जोडा. ठराविक आकडा न वापरता क्षेत्र, स्थानिक साहित्याचा भाव आणि तीन टप्प्यांचे प्रमाण यावरून ती काढा — उसाचे पाचट व गव्हाचे काड उपलब्ध असलेल्या या भागासाठी एकरी सुमारे १५,००० रुपये हा कामचलाऊ अंदाज आहे. तो एकूण खर्चाच्या सुमारे १०.५% आहे आणि सर्वात चांगला मोजलेला परतावा देतो — कंदकूज ५% पेक्षा कमी, तर जिल्हा सरासरी २० ते ३०%.',
  'Mulch appears in five domains — water, disease, weeds, temperature and organic carbon. Its documented effect on soft rot incidence is the strongest single number in the preventive stack, and soft rot is the largest loss factor in the crop. EXPERT AMENDMENT: the mulch provision must be computed from area, local material price and location rather than held at a fixed rupee figure.',
  'u = 0.20. On 113 quintal at Rs 4,000 that is about Rs 90,400 against a cost of Rs 15,000.',
  0.78, 'B', 'DERIVED', 0.2, 'none',
  'Absent from the cost sheet is why it is also absent from the field. An unbudgeted operation is the first one dropped when money is tight, and this is the one that should never be.');

