  'Budget being finalised AND drainage or micronutrient provision is absent',
  'अंदाजपत्रकात निचरा चर किंवा सूक्ष्म अन्नद्रव्यांची तरतूद नाही',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Add about Rs 4,000 for drainage channels and Rs 3,500 for two micronutrient sprays. Both are preconditions here rather than enhancements.',
  'निचरा चरांसाठी सुमारे ४,००० आणि सूक्ष्म अन्नद्रव्यांच्या दोन फवारण्यांसाठी ३,५०० रुपयांची तरतूद करा. इथे या दोन्ही सुधारणा नाहीत, पूर्वअटी आहेत.',
  'Three drainage levels are required before planting on vertisol, and the third — the outlet channel — is the one most often omitted. Micronutrient sprays are needed because free lime locks up zinc and iron, and foliar delivery beat soil application by 12.5 percent in trial.',
  'Drainage carries u = 0.22 and micronutrients u = 0.11.',
