  'Cost planning is being explained',
  'खर्चाचे नियोजन समजावून सांगायचे आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'State that seed is the largest single cost at 28 to 35 percent, about Rs 40,000 per acre at roughly Rs 47 per kg. Every seed decision — variety, source, rate, treatment, storage — is therefore also a cost decision.',
