  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Include the opportunity cost. Retaining 1,308 kg is not free — at Rs 47 per kg it is about Rs 61,500 of produce not sold. Compare that against the purchase cost of about Rs 40,000, not against zero.',
  'संधी-खर्च धरा. १,३०८ किलो बेणे राखणे फुकट नाही — प्रति किलो ४७ रुपये दराने ते सुमारे ६१,५०० रुपयांचा न विकलेला माल आहे. त्याची तुलना सुमारे ४०,००० रुपयांच्या खरेदी खर्चाशी करा, शून्याशी नाही.',
  'The comparison is normally made between a cash outlay and nothing, which makes retention look free. Including the foregone sale plus the storage loss makes the true retained cost about Rs 61,500 rather than zero.',
  'None. Corrects a systematically wrong comparison.',
  0.75, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'The answer depends on the price. At a low price the two are roughly equal; at a high price retention is expensive — but so is purchase, because seed is priced off the produce market.');

