  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Obtain a supplier quotation before completing the model. Drip capital cost is the largest missing figure in this domain and neither the with-subsidy nor the without-subsidy case can be closed without it.',
  'गणित पूर्ण करण्यापूर्वी पुरवठादाराकडून कोटेशन घ्या. ठिबकाचा भांडवली खर्च हा या Domain मधील सर्वात मोठा गहाळ आकडा आहे — तो नसेल तर अनुदानासह किंवा अनुदानाशिवाय कोणतेही गणित पूर्ण होत नाही.',
  'Drip is a precondition, so the cost is incurred regardless. Subsidy at 75 to 80 percent changes who bears it, and because selection is by lottery both cases must be modelled. Without the base figure neither can be.',
  'None. Determines whether the enterprise is viable and at what area.',
  0.8, 'B', 'FIELD', NULL, 'full',
  'One phone call to an irrigation supplier closes the largest open figure in the economics. It should have been made before the cost model was drafted.');

