  'Do not use it. The source used for the cost breakdown gives three different profit figures in one document — Rs 1.5 to 2 lakh in the introduction, Rs 4.05 lakh in the main table, and Rs 1.5 to 3 lakh in the FAQ. Use the cost side and reject the yield and profit side.',
