  'A document that contradicts itself three times on its central claim cannot be relied on for that claim. The FAQ figures of 80 to 120 quintal align with the independently revised target of 90 to 110, which suggests the main table figures are headline numbers rather than estimates.',
  'None. Prevents inflated expectations from entering the model.',
  0.85, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'A source can be reliable for one part of its content and not another. Splitting it rather than accepting or rejecting the whole is what let the cost breakdown be used at all.');

