  0.78, 'B', 'DERIVED', NULL, 'full',
  'Moving from 50 to 90 quintal at Rs 3,500 is worth more than moving the price from Rs 3,500 to Rs 5,000 at 50 quintal. The farmer controls one of those and not the other.');

