  'The main financial risk is being identified',
  'मुख्य आर्थिक जोखीम ठरवली जात आहे',
  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Name soft rot, not the market. The economics survive a price crash to Rs 2,000 and survive losing half the yield, but at 30 quintal from severe rot the return is near zero even at Rs 5,000, and about Rs 85,000 negative at Rs 2,000.',
  'बाजार नव्हे, कंदकूज. भाव २,००० पर्यंत कोसळला तरी आणि उत्पादन निम्मे झाले तरी अर्थशास्त्र टिकते — पण तीव्र कुजीमुळे ३० क्विंटलवर आल्यास ५,००० भावालाही परतावा जवळपास शून्य, आणि २,००० भावाला सुमारे ८५,००० रुपये तोटा.',
  'The matrix shows the loss region is confined to low yield combined with low price. Price alone does not produce a loss at target yield, and halved yield alone does not produce a loss at a reasonable price. Only severe crop loss does.',
  'Reframes the whole budget. Prevention spending is insurance rather than yield enhancement.',
  0.8, 'B', 'DERIVED', 0.7, 'none',
  'This is the finding that changes how the budget should be read. The prevention stack is not an optional improvement — it is the item protecting against the only scenario that produces a real loss.');

