  NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL,
  'Offer the mitigations. Marigold or coriander intercrop gives cash at two to three months against ginger''s eight; a crop loan smooths the gap at an interest cost; splitting the area with a shorter crop works; and an early green harvest at six months gives partial cash at lower weight.',
