COMMENT ON TABLE kb_duplication_members IS 'Where factors share a causal chain rather than merely a trigger — pest wound leading to rot, or FYM leading to weeds leading to weeding injury leading to rot — group them and apply the terminal u-value once rather than multiplying each link.';

